page_id":"/docs/advanced-eac","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-eac#github-授权令牌的来源","content":"`null` 或空字符串","locale":"zh-CN"},"43":{"id":"/docs/advanced-eac-41","page_id":"/docs/advanced-eac","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-eac#github-授权令牌的来源","content":"不带 `x-ofm-user`，即不使用本机的 GitHub 身份","locale":"zh-CN"},"44":{"id":"/docs/advanced-eac-42","page_id":"/docs/advanced-eac","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-eac#github-授权令牌的来源","content":"中继在没有授权时回答 `401 AuthorizationRequired`，网关会报告 `eac: the relay demands this install's GitHub authorization (set the account's user_token)`，并且不会因此去续期或换账号。","locale":"zh-CN"},"45":{"id":"/docs/advanced-eac-43","page_id":"/docs/advanced-eac","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-eac#自定义中继","content":"在 **渠道** 页为 EAC 添加账号时，可以选择内置中继（bundled）、自定义 worker 中继或 direct 中继。也可以直接写进配置：","locale":"zh-CN"},"46":{"id":"/docs/advanced-eac-44","page_id":"/docs/advanced-eac","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-eac#自定义中继","content":"要求：","locale":"zh-CN"},"47":{"id":"/docs/advanced-eac-45","page_id":"/docs/advanced-eac","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-eac#自定义中继","content":"`base_url` 是以 `/v1` 结尾的 HTTP(S) 地址，不带用户名密码、查询参数或片段；","locale":"zh-CN"},"48":{"id":"/docs/advanced-eac-46","page_id":"/docs/advanced-eac","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-eac#自定义中继","content":"自定义中继必须有 `signing_secret`（worker）或 `access_token`（direct）之一；","locale":"zh-CN"},"49":{"id":"/docs/advanced-eac-47","page_id":"/docs/advanced-eac","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-eac#自定义中继","content":"`relay: \"bundled\"` 的账号不能同时写 `base_url`、`signing_secret` 或 `access_token`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"50":{"id":"/docs/advanced-eac-48","page_id":"/docs/advanced-eac","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-eac#自定义中继","content":"GitHub 登录只适用于 worker 中继；direct 中继直接使用它的 Bearer 凭据。","locale":"zh-CN"},"51":{"id":"/docs/advanced-eac-49","page_id":"/docs/advanced-eac","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-eac#自定义中继","content":"对已有的 worker 账号执行登录，会更新这个账号的授权，保留它的地址和签名密钥。登录时 Hoshimi 优先选择内置中继账号或带 `signing_secret` 的账号。","locale":"zh-CN"},"52":{"id":"/docs/advanced-eac-50","page_id":"/docs/advanced-eac","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-eac#常见错误","content":"信息","locale":"zh-CN"},"53":{"id":"/docs/advanced-eac-51","page_id":"/docs/advanced-eac","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-eac#常见错误","content":"原因与处理","locale":"zh-CN"},"54":{"id":"/docs/advanced-eac-52","page_id":"/docs/advanced-eac","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-eac#常见错误","content":"`eac: the GitHub account has not starred the upstream repository`","locale":"zh-CN"},"55":{"id":"/docs/advanced-eac-53","page_id":"/docs/advanced-eac","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-eac#常见错误","content":"授权用的 GitHub 账号没有为上游仓库点 Star","locale":"zh-CN"},"56":{"id":"/docs/advanced-eac-54","page_id":"/docs/advanced-eac","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-eac#常见错误","content":"`eac: authorization expired, please start again`","locale":"zh-CN"},"57":{"id":"/docs/advanced-eac-55","page_id":"/docs/advanced-eac","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-eac#常见错误","content":"授权链接过期，重新登录","locale":"zh-CN"},"58":{"id":"/docs/advanced-eac-56","page_id":"/docs/advanced-eac","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-eac#常见错误","content":"`eac: login timed out (last status: …)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"59":{"id":"/docs/advanced-eac-57","page_id":"/docs/advanced-eac","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-eac#常见错误","content":"在时限内没有完成授权","locale":"zh-CN"},"60":{"id":"/docs/advanced-eac-58","page_id":"/docs/advanced-eac","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-eac#常见错误","content":"`eac: cannot reach the authorization service (…)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"61":{"id":"/docs/advanced-eac-59","page_id":"/docs/advanced-eac","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-eac#常见错误","content":"连不上中继，检查网络或代理，见网络与代理","locale":"zh-CN"},"62":{"id":"/docs/advanced-eac-60","page_id":"/docs/advanced-eac","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-eac#常见错误","content":"`eac: GitHub authorization requires a worker relay; direct relays use their existing Bearer token`","locale":"zh-CN"},"63":{"id":"/docs/advanced-eac-61","page_id":"/docs/advanced-eac","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-eac#常见错误","content":"对 direct 中继发起了 GitHub 登录","locale":"zh-CN"},"64":{"id":"/docs/advanced-eac-62","page_id":"/docs/advanced-eac","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-eac#常见错误","content":"`eac: configure a worker relay with base_url and signing_secret, or use the bundled relay`","locale":"zh-CN"},"65":{"id":"/docs/advanced-eac-63","page_id":"/docs/advanced-eac","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-eac#常见错误","content":"账号既不是内置中继，也没有 `base_url`","locale":"zh-CN"},"66":{"id":"/docs/advanced-eac-64","page_id":"/docs/advanced-eac","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-eac#常见错误","content":"`eac: base_url must be an HTTP(S) relay URL ending in /v1, without credentials, query or fragment`","locale":"zh-CN"},"67":{"id":"/docs/advanced-eac-65","page_id":"/docs/advanced-eac","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-eac#常见错误","content":"中继地址格式不对","locale":"zh-CN"},"68":{"id":"/docs/advanced-eac-66","page_id":"/docs/advanced-eac","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-eac#常见错误","content":"`eac: a custom relay needs signing_secret (worker) or access_token (direct)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"69":{"id":"/docs/advanced-eac-67","page_id":"/docs/advanced-eac","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-eac#常见错误","content":"自定义中继缺少凭据","locale":"zh-CN"},"70":{"id":"/docs/advanced-eac-68","page_id":"/docs/advanced-eac","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-eac#常见错误","content":"`eac: a bundled relay reference cannot also specify a custom relay`","locale":"zh-CN"},"71":{"id":"/docs/advanced-eac-69","page_id":"/docs/advanced-eac","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-eac#常见错误","content":"`relay: \"bundled\"` 的账号里又写了自定义字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"72":{"id":"/docs/advanced-eac-70","page_id":"/docs/advanced-eac","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-eac#常见错误","content":"`eac: the bundled relay configuration is unavailable; configure your own worker relay or update Hoshimi`","locale":"zh-CN"},"73":{"id":"/docs/advanced-eac-71","page_id":"/docs/advanced-eac","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-eac#常见错误","content":"内置中继凭据无法使用，升级 Hoshimi 或改用自己的中继","locale":"zh-CN"},"74":{"id":"/docs/advanced-eac-72","page_id":"/docs/advanced-eac","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-eac#常见错误","content":"`eac: failed to persist the per-install authorization; check data-dir permissions`","locale":"zh-CN"},"75":{"id":"/docs/advanced-eac-73","page_id":"/docs/advanced-eac","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-eac#常见错误","content":"无法写入 `eac-user.json`，检查数据目录的权限","locale":"zh-CN"},"76":{"id":"/docs/advanced-eac-74","page_id":"/docs/advanced-eac","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-eac#常见错误","content":"`eac: the relay account changed or was removed during login; start again`","locale":"zh-CN"},"77":{"id":"/docs/advanced-eac-75","page_id":"/docs/advanced-eac","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-eac#常见错误","content":"登录过程中账号被修改或删除","locale":"zh-CN"},"78":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","type":"page","content":"常见问题","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","进阶"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-faq","locale":"zh-CN"},"79":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-0","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq","content":"按主题整理的常见问题：数据和日志在哪里、运行中能否改配置、该用哪把密钥、模型 id 冲突、免费标记、推理强度、账号轮换、签到和续期、代理，以及 Hoshimi 自己会发出哪些请求。","locale":"zh-CN"},"80":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-1","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-faq#数据与文件","content":"数据与文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"81":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-2","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-faq#访问与安全","content":"访问与安全","locale":"zh-CN"},"82":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-3","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-faq#模型","content":"模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"83":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-4","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-faq#账号","content":"账号","locale":"zh-CN"},"84":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-5","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-faq#网络与隐私","content":"网络与隐私","locale":"zh-CN"},"85":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-6","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq","content":"遇到具体的错误信息时，先看故障排查。","locale":"zh-CN"},"86":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-7","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#数据与文件","content":"都在数据目录里：Linux 为 `~/.local/share/hoshimi`，macOS 为 `~/Library/Application Support/hoshimi`，Windows 为 `%APPDATA%\\hoshimi`，可以用 `HOSHIMI_DATA_DIR` 换到别处。其中 `config.json` 是设置和账号，`hoshimi.db` 是用量、签到、探测结果和 Playground 对话。","locale":"zh-CN"},"87":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-8","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#数据与文件","content":"网页界面的 **设置** › **关于** 也显示 **数据目录**、**配置文件** 和 **数据库**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"88":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-9","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#数据与文件","content":"Hoshimi 不写日志文件，日志输出到运行 `hoshimi serve` 的终端（stderr）。需要文件时自己重定向，例如 `hoshimi serve 2>> hoshimi.log`；作为系统服务运行时由服务管理器收集。详见数据目录与迁移。","locale":"zh-CN"},"89":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-10","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#数据与文件","content":"可以改，但要重启服务器才生效，而且**在重启之前**，服务器的任何一次写入（在网页上保存设置、登录、续期令牌）都会把它内存中的配置写回文件，覆盖你的修改。所以正确的顺序是：停止服务器，修改，再启动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"90":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-11","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#数据与文件","content":"在网页上改设置则立即生效，不需要重启（监听地址和端口除外）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"91":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-12","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#数据与文件","content":"可以。它们读写同一个数据目录（前提是 `HOSHIMI_DATA_DIR` 相同）；数据库支持多个进程同时访问。只有配置文件需要注意上一条：命令行对配置的修改要在服务器重启后才生效。","locale":"zh-CN"},"92":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-13","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#数据与文件","content":"停止服务器后：","locale":"zh-CN"},"93":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-14","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#数据与文件","content":"搬家：复制整个数据目录，在新机器上放到默认位置，或用 `HOSHIMI_DATA_DIR` 指向它；","locale":"zh-CN"},"94":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-15","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#数据与文件","content":"恢复默认设置：把 `config.json` 改名。注意渠道账号也在这个文件里；","locale":"zh-CN"},"95":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-16","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#数据与文件","content":"清空所有记录：删除 `hoshimi.db`，配置和账号不受影响。","locale":"zh-CN"},"96":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-17","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#数据与文件","content":"不会。用量记录只有模型、渠道、账号、token 数、耗时和简短的错误说明，错误说明中形似密钥的内容会被遮盖。Playground 的对话则保存在 `hoshimi.db` 中，直到你删除它们；临时对话在离开时和下次启动时删除。见用量统计。","locale":"zh-CN"},"97":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-18","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#访问与安全","content":"默认只监听 `127.0.0.1`，其他机器连不上；网关还会检查 `Host` 和浏览器来源，阻止恶意网页通过你的浏览器访问它。所以单人使用的电脑可以不设密钥。如果这台电脑上还有其他用户或你不信任的程序，设置工具访问密钥和模型 API 密钥。","locale":"zh-CN"},"98":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-19","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#访问与安全","content":"编辑器插件、Agent、SDK 等调用 `/v1/*` 的客户端用 **模型 API 密钥**（`server.model_api_key`）。网页界面、Playground 和管理接口 `/api/*` 用 **工具访问密钥**（`server.access_token`）。两把密钥互不通用；没有设置的那把，对应的接口就不需要密钥。见访问控制。","locale":"zh-CN"},"99":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-20","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#访问与安全","content":"密钥保存后不会再显示。停止服务器，设置一个新的再启动：","locale":"zh-CN"},"100":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-21","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#访问与安全","content":"或用 `hoshimi config set server.access_token null` 取消它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"101":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-22","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#访问与安全","content":"设置工具访问密钥、模型 API 密钥和 `security.allow_cidrs`，把 `server.host` 改为 `0.0.0.0`，然后重启。缺少其中任何一项前提时，服务器会拒绝在非回环地址上启动。完整步骤见访问控制。","locale":"zh-CN"},"102":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-23","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#模型","content":"只写模型 id 时，网关按内置的渠道顺序找第一个列出它的渠道，`/v1/models` 也只列出那一条。要指定渠道，写成 `渠道/模型`，例如 `kilo/<模型 id>`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"103":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-24","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#模型","content":"`null` 表示站点没有说明这个模型是否免费。Hoshimi 只在有证据（站点的价格、免费标签或价格文档）时才标 `true` 或 `false`，不会猜测。免费标记也不保证有额度。见 pi-free 迁移与差异。","locale":"zh-CN"},"104":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-25","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#模型","content":"对没有自己档位菜单的推理模型，上游并不执行 `reasoning_effort`，真正起作用的只有输出上限，所以网关把档位换算成 `max_tokens`：`light` 2,048、`balanced` 8,192、`deep` 用满模型的输出上限（不能关闭思考的模型加倍，最低 512）。不发送档位时，你设置的 `max_tokens` 原样保留。见模型与账号行为。","locale":"zh-CN"},"105":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-26","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#模型","content":"不会。网关只调用你请求的那个模型，失败时在同一渠道内换账号重试；模型由调用方决定。上游说模型不存在时，网关会暂时记住，在一段时间内直接返回 `503 model_unavailable`，而不是改用另一个模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"106":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-27","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#模型","content":"这个模型被记为暂时不可用：上游的账号都说它不存在。10 分钟后自动解除（10 分钟内 3 次则持续到重启）。上游恢复后可以用 `POST /api/v1/models/unavailable/reset` 立即解除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"107":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-28","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#模型","content":"会，但很少：每个模型发送一条 `ping`，最多 64 个 token，同时最多 2 个。默认只探测 `opencode`、`nvidia` 和 `agg` 这几个列表无法说明可用性的渠道；也可以只探测指定的模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"108":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-29","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#账号","content":"最多 `server.max_account_retries` 个（默认 3）。凭据被拒、限流、服务器错误时会换账号；请求本身有问题（如 400、422）时不会换，因为换哪个账号都一样。已经向你输出了内容的请求绝不会被自动重发，所以不会收到重复的回答。","locale":"zh-CN"},"109":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-30","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#账号","content":"开启 **每日签到** 时，服务器启动 30 秒后运行一次，之后每 24 小时一次，按北京时间（UTC+8）的日历日判断当天是否已经签过。所有账号逐个依次签到，不并发。在 **渠道** 页可以 **立即签到** 或 **全部签到**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"110":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-31","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#账号","content":"定时器只在服务器启动时开启，运行中关掉开关不会停止它。另外，`hoshimi serve` 启动时用 `--refresh/--no-refresh`（默认开启）覆盖这个设置，`--checkin/--no-checkin` 同理。要关闭，用 `hoshimi serve --no-refresh` 或 `--no-checkin` 启动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"111":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-32","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#账号","content":"暂停记录只在内存中，重启服务器会清除。但暂停通常是因为上游限流（时长取自上游的说明，没有说明时为 1 小时）或策略拦截（30 分钟），重启并不会解除上游的限制，账号很快会被再次暂停。","locale":"zh-CN"},"112":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-33","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#网络与隐私","content":"默认的 `auto` 模式读取 `HTTPS_PROXY`、`HTTP_PROXY`、`ALL_PROXY` 和 `NO_PROXY` 环境变量。Windows 上可以打开 **无环境代理时使用 Windows 系统代理**，在没有环境变量时使用系统代理。也可以直接指定一个代理，或为单个渠道设置不同的线路。见网络与代理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"113":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-34","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#网络与隐私","content":"在浏览器中打开的登录页面使用浏览器自己的网络设置。网关自己在登录过程中发出的请求（发起授权、轮询、换取令牌）使用这个渠道的网络策略。","locale":"zh-CN"},"114":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-35","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#网络与隐私","content":"请求","locale":"zh-CN"},"115":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-36","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#网络与隐私","content":"何时","locale":"zh-CN"},"116":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-37","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#网络与隐私","content":"如何关闭","locale":"zh-CN"},"117":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-38","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#网络与隐私","content":"各渠道的模型目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"118":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-39","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#网络与隐私","content":"列出模型或按模型 id 查找渠道时（包括打开 **模型** 页、Playground 和运行 `hoshimi check`），之后缓存 5 分钟","locale":"zh-CN"},"119":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-40","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#网络与隐私","content":"关闭不用的渠道，包括两个免账号渠道 `opencode` 和 `kilo`","locale":"zh-CN"},"120":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-41","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#网络与隐私","content":"凭据续期","locale":"zh-CN"},"121":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-42","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#网络与隐私","content":"每 30 分钟一轮，只针对快过期的账号","locale":"zh-CN"},"122":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-43","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#网络与隐私","content":"`hoshimi serve --no-refresh`","locale":"zh-CN"},"123":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-44","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#网络与隐私","content":"每日签到","locale":"zh-CN"},"124":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-45","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#网络与隐私","content":"每天一次","locale":"zh-CN"},"125":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-46","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#网络与隐私","content":"`hoshimi serve --no-checkin`","locale":"zh-CN"},"126":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-47","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#网络与隐私","content":"余额查询","locale":"zh-CN"},"127":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-48","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#网络与隐私","content":"只在打开 **渠道** 页或调用 `GET /api/v1/credits` 时","locale":"zh-CN"},"128":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-49","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#网络与隐私","content":"不打开就不会查询","locale":"zh-CN"},"129":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-50","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#网络与隐私","content":"PyPI 新版本检查","locale":"zh-CN"},"130":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-51","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#网络与隐私","content":"启动时和之后每天一次","locale":"zh-CN"},"131":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-52","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#网络与隐私","content":"`server.check_updates: false`","locale":"zh-CN"},"132":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-53","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#网络与隐私","content":"models.dev 能力元数据","locale":"zh-CN"},"133":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-54","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#网络与隐私","content":"需要为没有声明的模型补充视觉和推理信息时，在后台拉取","locale":"zh-CN"},"134":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-55","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#网络与隐私","content":"无开关；失败时使用内置快照，不影响请求","locale":"zh-CN"},"135":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-56","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#网络与隐私","content":"Hoshimi 不发送遥测数据。","locale":"zh-CN"},"136":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","type":"page","content":"模型与账号行为","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","进阶"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-models","locale":"zh-CN"},"137":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-0","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models","content":"模型名如何路由到渠道，目录如何发现和缓存，能力和推理强度如何决定请求体，可用性探测，以及失败时如何换账号、重试、续期和记录额度。","locale":"zh-CN"},"138":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-1","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-models#模型名如何路由","content":"模型名如何路由","locale":"zh-CN"},"139":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-2","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-models#模型目录","content":"模型目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"140":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-3","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-models#能力信息","content":"能力信息","locale":"zh-CN"},"141":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-4","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-models#推理强度","content":"推理强度","locale":"zh-CN"},"142":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-5","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-models#可用性探测","content":"可用性探测","locale":"zh-CN"},"143":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-6","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-models#记住失效的模型","content":"记住失效的模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"144":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-7","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-models#账号轮换与重试","content":"账号轮换与重试","locale":"zh-CN"},"145":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-8","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-models#凭据续期","content":"凭据续期","locale":"zh-CN"},"146":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-9","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-models#余额签到与被动额度","content":"余额、签到与被动额度","locale":"zh-CN"},"147":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-10","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-models#余额和签到","content":"余额和签到","locale":"zh-CN"},"148":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-11","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-models#被动额度","content":"被动额度","locale":"zh-CN"},"149":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-12","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models","content":"本页讲网关在一个请求背后做的决定：把模型名交给哪个渠道，这个模型能做什么，`reasoning_effort` 最终变成了什么，失败时换不换账号、等不等、重不重试。日常使用不需要了解这些；当结果和预期不一样时，这里是答案。","locale":"zh-CN"},"150":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-13","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#模型名如何路由","content":"请求里的 `model` 按下面的顺序解析：","locale":"zh-CN"},"151":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-14","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#模型名如何路由","content":"写成 `渠道/模型`（如 `kilo/some-model`），且 `渠道` 是一个正在运行的渠道 id：直接交给它，斜杠后面的部分原样作为上游模型名。","locale":"zh-CN"},"152":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-15","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#模型名如何路由","content":"只写模型 id：按内置的渠道顺序（`cline`、`opencode`、`kilo`、`gemini`、`zcode`、`minimax`、`trae`、`qoder`……）找第一个在目录中列出这个 id 的渠道。","locale":"zh-CN"},"153":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-16","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#模型名如何路由","content":"都没找到，但只有一个渠道在运行：原样转发给它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"154":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-17","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#模型名如何路由","content":"否则返回 `404 model_not_found`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"155":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-18","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#模型名如何路由","content":"请求没有带 `model` 时使用 `server.default_model`；也没有设置时返回 `model is required`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"156":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-19","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#模型名如何路由","content":"同一个 id 出现在多个渠道时，`/v1/models` 只列出第一个渠道的那一条。想指定渠道，就用 `渠道/模型` 的写法。","locale":"zh-CN"},"157":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-20","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#模型目录","content":"每个渠道的模型列表来自上游自己的列表接口，能力信息来自 Hoshimi 内置的能力表和账号中的声明。","locale":"zh-CN"},"158":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-21","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#模型目录","content":"**缓存 5 分钟**：同一渠道的列表在 5 分钟内不会重复拉取。","locale":"zh-CN"},"159":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-22","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#模型目录","content":"**防止异常缩水**：新拉到的列表不到上一次的一半时，先保留旧列表一个周期，并在日志里警告 `the catalogue came back at N of M models (likely a partial answer)`；再过一个周期仍然如此，才接受新列表。","locale":"zh-CN"},"160":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-23","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#模型目录","content":"**失败时保留旧的**：拉取失败时保留上一次成功的目录，30 秒后再试。从未成功过的渠道使用它内置的后备列表；后备列表只是历史数据，不代表这些模型现在可用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"161":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-24","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#模型目录","content":"**跨重启保留**：每次成功的目录保存在数据目录的 `catalog-cache/` 中，启动时先恢复（只恢复 7 天以内、账号和选项完全相同的快照），然后立即在后台刷新。","locale":"zh-CN"},"162":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-25","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#模型目录","content":"网页界面的 **模型** 页和 Playground 通过 `GET /api/v1/catalog/stream`（SSE）加载目录：先发出已缓存的结果，再按渠道逐个发出新结果。拉取最多同时进行 8 个；一轮最多等 20 秒，没完成的渠道标记为超时，已经收到的模型保留。标准的 `/v1/models` 仍然是普通 JSON。","locale":"zh-CN"},"163":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-26","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#能力信息","content":"管理接口 `GET /api/v1/models` 给出每个模型的能力：","locale":"zh-CN"},"164":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-27","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#能力信息","content":"字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"165":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-28","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#能力信息","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"166":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-29","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#能力信息","content":"`vision`","locale":"zh-CN"},"167":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-30","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#能力信息","content":"能否读图","lo