ooting#网络与代理","content":"站点只允许自己的客户端使用免费额度","locale":"zh-CN"},"509":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-113","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网络与代理","content":"`…: signature_rejected; check_request_integrity`","locale":"zh-CN"},"510":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-114","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网络与代理","content":"站点拒绝了请求签名","locale":"zh-CN"},"511":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-115","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网络与代理","content":"这些都不会让账号作废，也不会触发换账号。","locale":"zh-CN"},"512":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-116","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网络与代理","content":"还要注意：","locale":"zh-CN"},"513":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-117","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网络与代理","content":"`auto` 模式读取的是服务器进程启动时的环境变量；在另一个终端里设置的 `HTTPS_PROXY` 对已经运行的服务器无效。小写的 `https_proxy` 优先于大写。","locale":"zh-CN"},"514":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-118","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网络与代理","content":"环境变量里的代理地址写错时，请求会报错而不是被忽略。","locale":"zh-CN"},"515":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-119","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网络与代理","content":"`network.system_proxy` 只在 Windows 上有效。","locale":"zh-CN"},"516":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-120","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网络与代理","content":"SOCKS 代理对 Bedrock 的 AWS SDK 无效，Bedrock 需要 HTTP(S) 代理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"517":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-121","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网络与代理","content":"本机地址（如本地的 Ollama）始终直连，不经过代理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"518":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-122","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网络与代理","content":"配置方法见网络与代理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"519":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-123","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#站点拒绝图片或工具","content":"模型不能读图（能力中 `vision` 为 `false`）时，Playground 用 **图片模型**（`playground.vision_model`）先把图片描述成文字再发送，并在回复上方提示 **此模型无法读取图片，图片“…”已由 … 描述后发送。** 找不到能读图的模型，或 **图片模型** 设为 **关闭** 时，提示 **图片“…”已略去：没有可读取它的模型。**","locale":"zh-CN"},"520":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-124","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#站点拒绝图片或工具","content":"模型本应能读图，上游却在回复开始前拒绝了图片（错误中提到 image、vision、multimodal 等）时，Playground 自动改用描述重试一次，提示 **… 拒绝了图片，因此改为发送图片描述。**","locale":"zh-CN"},"521":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-125","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#站点拒绝图片或工具","content":"通过 API 调用时网关不做这种转换，上游的错误会原样返回。给不能读图的模型发图片，请先换一个 `vision` 为 `true` 的模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"522":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-126","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#站点拒绝图片或工具","content":"模型不支持工具调用，或上游在回复开始前拒绝了 `tools`（错误中提到 tool、tool_choice、function call）时，Playground 去掉工具重试，提示 **… 不支持调用工具，因此在没有工具的情况下作答。** 换一个支持工具调用的模型（**模型** 页的 **工具调用**）。工具的开关和询问模式见 Playground 工具。","locale":"zh-CN"},"523":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-127","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#站点拒绝图片或工具","content":"通过 API 调用时，上游对 `tools` 的拒绝原样返回给客户端。","locale":"zh-CN"},"524":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-128","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#数据与文件","content":"`hoshimi.db` 被更新版本的 Hoshimi 用过，而现在运行的是旧版本。旧版本仍可运行，但部分记录可能显示不正确。升级到新版本，或从备份恢复数据目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"525":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-129","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#数据与文件","content":"`hoshimi config set` 和手动编辑都要重启服务器才生效。更重要的是，服务器运行期间，每次在网页上保存设置、登录或续期，都会把内存中的配置写回 `config.json`，覆盖运行期间对文件的修改。先停止服务器，再修改文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"526":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-130","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#数据与文件","content":"升级后导入旧的 JSON 记录时，这个文件无法读取，被改名放在一边，对应的记录从空开始。不影响其他功能；不需要时可以删除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"527":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-131","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#数据与文件","content":"仍然解决不了时，带上 `HOSHIMI_LOG_LEVEL=DEBUG` 下的日志、`hoshimi version` 的输出和复现步骤，到 GitHub Issues 反馈。日志可能包含账号 id 和主机名，分享前检查一遍。","locale":"zh-CN"},"528":{"id":"/docs/advanced-usage","page_id":"/docs/advanced-usage","type":"page","content":"用量统计","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","进阶"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-usage","locale":"zh-CN"},"529":{"id":"/docs/advanced-usage-0","page_id":"/docs/advanced-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-usage","content":"网关如何记录每一次调用：记录哪些字段、token 和缓存从哪里来、速度怎么算、保存多久、如何查询，以及实时视图的事件流。","locale":"zh-CN"},"530":{"id":"/docs/advanced-usage-1","page_id":"/docs/advanced-usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-usage#记录什么","content":"记录什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"531":{"id":"/docs/advanced-usage-2","page_id":"/docs/advanced-usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-usage#token-和缓存从哪里来","content":"token 和缓存从哪里来","locale":"zh-CN"},"532":{"id":"/docs/advanced-usage-3","page_id":"/docs/advanced-usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-usage#首字时间和速度","content":"首字时间和速度","locale":"zh-CN"},"533":{"id":"/docs/advanced-usage-4","page_id":"/docs/advanced