ent":"错误说明只保留一行、最多 160 个字符，形似密钥的内容（`Bearer …`、`sk-…`、32 位以上的随机串等）会被替换为 `***`。带状态码的上游错误只记为 `upstream returned HTTP <状态码>`，摘要中不保存上游正文（独立的请求与响应详情会保留采集到的正文）；流中错误帧的说明按上面的规则截短并遮盖后保存。","locale":"zh-CN"},"602":{"id":"/docs/advanced-usage-73","page_id":"/docs/advanced-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-usage#token-和缓存从哪里来","content":"所有渠道的用量先被统一成 OpenAI 的字段，再记入统计：","locale":"zh-CN"},"603":{"id":"/docs/advanced-usage-74","page_id":"/docs/advanced-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-usage#token-和缓存从哪里来","content":"记录字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"604":{"id":"/docs/advanced-usage-75","page_id":"/docs/advanced-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-usage#token-和缓存从哪里来","content":"读取自","locale":"zh-CN"},"605":{"id":"/docs/advanced-usage-76","page_id":"/docs/advanced-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-usage#token-和缓存从哪里来","content":"`input`","locale":"zh-CN"},"606":{"id":"/docs/advanced-usage-77","page_id":"/docs/advanced-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-usage#token-和缓存从哪里来","content":"`prompt_tokens`","locale":"zh-CN"},"607":{"id":"/docs/advanced-usage-78","page_id":"/docs/advanced-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-usage#token-和缓存从哪里来","content":"`output`","locale":"zh-CN"},"608":{"id":"/docs/advanced-usage-79","page_id":"/docs/advanced-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-usage#token-和缓存从哪里来","content":"`completion_tokens`","locale":"zh-CN"},"609":{"id":"/docs/advanced-usage-80","page_id":"/docs/advanced-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-usage#token-和缓存从哪里来","content":"`reasoning`","locale":"zh-CN"},"610":{"id":"/docs/advanced-usage-81","page_id":"/docs/advanced-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-usage#token-和缓存从哪里来","content":"`completion_tokens_details.reasoning_tokens`","locale":"zh-CN"},"611":{"id":"/docs/advanced-usage-82","page_id":"/docs/advanced-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-usage#token-和缓存从哪里来","con