悄悄换成协议转换。","locale":"zh-CN"},"718":{"id":"/docs/api-anthropic-33","page_id":"/docs/api-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-anthropic#原生转发还是协议转换","content":"渠道的这几个选项（写在 `providers.<id>.options` 中）可以调整这个行为：","locale":"zh-CN"},"719":{"id":"/docs/api-anthropic-34","page_id":"/docs/api-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-anthropic#原生转发还是协议转换","content":"选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"720":{"id":"/docs/api-anthropic-35","page_id":"/docs/api-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-anthropic#原生转发还是协议转换","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"721":{"id":"/docs/api-anthropic-36","page_id":"/docs/api-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-anthropic#原生转发还是协议转换","content":"`messages_passthrough: false`","locale":"zh-CN"},"722":{"id":"/docs/api-anthropic-37","page_id":"/docs/api-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-anthropic#原生转发还是协议转换","content":"不走原生转发，强制协议转换，用于有特殊要求的 Messages 渠道","locale":"zh-CN"},"723":{"id":"/docs/api-anthropic-38","page_id":"/docs/api-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-anthropic#原生转发还是协议转换","content":"`messages_count_tokens: true`","locale":"zh-CN"},"724":{"id":"/docs/api-anthropic-39","page_id":"/docs/api-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-anthropic#原生转发还是协议转换","content":"为 `count_tokens` 使用上游的原生计数接口；`anthropic` 渠道默认开启，其他渠道默认关闭","locale":"zh-CN"},"725":{"id":"/docs/api-anthropic-40","page_id":"/docs/api-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-anthropic#原生转发还是协议转换","content":"`structured_outputs: true`","locale":"zh-CN"},"726":{"id":"/docs/api-anthropic-41","page_id":"/docs/api-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-anthropic#原生转发还是协议转换","content":"允许协议转换路径把 `output_config.format` 转成上游的结构化输出；只在上游和模型确实支持时开启","locale":"zh-CN"},"727":{"id":"/docs/api-anthropic-42","page_id":"/docs/api-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-anthropic#原生转发","content":"请求体原样发送，只把 `model` 换成上游的模型名（`count_tokens` 还会去掉 `stream`）。系统提示数组、内容顺序、不透明的签名、工具、缓存标记、`context_management`、结构化输出以及将来新增的字段都由上游校验。","locale":"zh-CN"},"728":{"id":"/docs/api-anthropic-43","page_id":"/docs/api-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-anthropic#原生转发","content":"客户端的 `anthropic-*` 请求头和查询参数会带上；上游凭据来自所选账号，客户端发给网关的密钥永远不会转发。OAuth 账号必需的 `anthropic-beta` 能力会与客户端的合并。","locale":"zh-CN"},"729":{"id":"/docs/api-anthropic-44","page_id":"/docs/api-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-anthropic#原生转发","content":"响应保留 `content-type`、`request-id`、`x-request-id`、`retry-after`（取整为秒）、`x-should-retry` 和全部 `anthropic-*` 响应头。","locale":"zh-CN"},"730":{"id":"/docs/api-anthropic-45","page_id":"/docs/api-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-anthropic#原生转发","content":"流式响应逐帧保留上游的 SSE，包括未知事件、用量、签名和 ping；Hoshimi 只在完整的帧之间插入自己的 `ping`，不会插进半截 JSON。非流式的 JSON 也原样返回。","locale":"zh-CN"},"731":{"id":"/docs/api-anthropic-46","page_id":"/docs/api-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-anthropic#原生转发","content":"上游的流没有以 `message_stop` 或 `error` 结束，或在一帧中途断开时，Hoshimi 报告错误，而不是当作正常结束。","locale":"zh-CN"},"732":{"id":"/docs/api-anthropic-47","page_id":"/docs/api-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-anthropic#原生转发","content":"客户端断开时，Hoshimi 关闭上游连接；已经开始的流不会换账号重放。","locale":"zh-CN"},"733":{"id":"/docs/api-anthropic-48","page_id":"/docs/api-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-anthropic#原生转发","content":"上游错误保留状态码、响应体、请求 ID 和协议头（包括 `x-should-retry`、`retry-after`、`anthropic-ratelimit-*`）。上游明确返回 `x-should-retry: false` 时，Hoshimi 不再换账号重试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"734":{"id":"/docs/api-anthropic-49","page_id":"/docs/api-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-anthropic#原生转发","content":"能原样转发不等于上游都支持：Anthropic 形式的端点仍可能拒绝它没有实现的功能，原始错误会返回给客户端。","locale":"zh-CN"},"735":{"id":"/docs/api-anthropic-50","page_id":"/docs/api-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-anthropic#协议转换","content":"转换路径把 Messages 请求变成内部的 Chat 请求，交给渠道的适配器，再把结果变回 Messages。","locale":"zh-CN"},"736":{"id":"/docs/api-anthropic-