ocs/api-management-107","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#应用","content":"`default_model`","locale":"zh-CN"},"963":{"id":"/docs/api-management-108","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#应用","content":"默认模型，没有时为 `null`","locale":"zh-CN"},"964":{"id":"/docs/api-management-109","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#应用","content":"`providers` / `accounts`","locale":"zh-CN"},"965":{"id":"/docs/api-management-110","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#应用","content":"已启用的渠道数和账号数（不含匿名账号）","locale":"zh-CN"},"966":{"id":"/docs/api-management-111","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#应用","content":"`GET /app/update` 返回 `status`、`current`、`latest`（PyPI 上最新的正式版本，知道后才有）和 `checked_at`（最近一次成功检查的 Unix 秒）。`status` 为 `checking`（首次检查尚未完成）、`available`、`current`、`failed`（还没有成功过；之后的失败保留上次的结果）或 `disabled`（`server.check_updates` 关闭）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"967":{"id":"/docs/api-management-112","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#设置","content":"`GET /settings` 返回当前设置：`data_dir`、`config_path`、`server`（地址、端口、`strict_port`、`access_token_configured`、`model_api_key_configured`、允许的 CIDR/主机/来源、`max_body_bytes`、`max_account_retries`、`default_model`、`auto_refresh`、`auto_checkin`、`check_updates`、`stats_keep_days`）、`providers`（每个渠道的 `id`、`enabled`、账号数、已设置的选项名、网络设置）、`network`、`playground`，以及：","locale":"zh-CN"},"968":{"id":"/docs/api-management-113","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#设置","content":"`restart_required`：保存的 `server.host` / `server.port` 与本次启动时不同，需要重启才生效。","locale":"zh-CN"},"969":{"id":"/docs/api-management-114","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#设置","content":"`playground.workspace_path`、`playground.shell_in_effect` 和 `playground.shells`（只读）：工具实际的工作目录、调用未指定 shell 时命令运行所用的 shell（`auto` 已解析），以及本机已安装的 shell。","locale":"zh-CN"},"970":{"id":"/docs/api-management-115","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#设置","content":"`listening`：实际监听的套接字，`port` 为绑定的端口，`requested_port` 为开始尝试的端口，`fallback` 表示请求的端口被占用而改用了其他端口（这不是需要重启的原因）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"971":{"id":"/docs/api-management-116","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#设置","content":"密钥本身永远不会返回。","locale":"zh-CN"},"972":{"id":"/docs/api-management-117","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#设置","content":"`PATCH /settings` 的请求体是部分配置，按 `config.json` 的结构深度合并，校验通过后写入配置文件并应用到运行中的网关，返回新的设置：","locale":"zh-CN"},"973":{"id":"/docs/api-management-118","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#设置","content":"`server.access_token` 或 `server.model_api_key` 设为 `null`（或空字符串）表示清除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"974":{"id":"/docs/api-management-119","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#设置","content":"无效的值返回 `400` 并说明原因，例如绑定非回环地址却没有同时设置 `security.allow_cidrs` 和 `server.access_token`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"975":{"id":"/docs/api-management-120","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#设置","content":"改了监听地址或端口时，`restart_required` 变为 `true`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"976":{"id":"/docs/api-management-121","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#设置","content":"`{\"playground\": {\"approval\": \"auto\"}}` 会保存为 `workspace`，即该模式的新名称。","locale":"zh-CN"},"977":{"id":"/docs/api-management-122","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#设置","content":"配置项的含义见配置文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"978":{"id":"/docs/api-management-123","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#渠道与账号","content":"`GET /providers` 的每一项：`id`、`display_name`、`accounts`（不含匿名账号）、`account_ids`、`models`（已缓存的模型数，从不为此请求上游）、`enabled`、`keyless`（无需账号即可使用）、`requires_authorization`（需要登录或 Key 才能使用）。已配置但关闭的渠道、可以登录或填 Key 但尚未配置的渠道也会列出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"979":{"id":"/docs/api-management-124","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#渠道与账号","content":"`GET /provider-forms` 列出每个渠道添加账号时可用的方式（`method`）及字段（`key`、`kind`、`required`、`choices`）和默认值。","locale":"zh-CN"},"980":{"id":"/docs/api-management-125","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#渠道与账号","content":"`POST /providers/{provider_id}/accounts` 追加一个账号，请求体中的 `account` 与写在 `config.json` 里的形式完全相同：","locale":"zh-CN"},"981":{"id":"/docs/api-management-126","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#渠道与账号","content":"只追加，不替换已有账号；渠道先检查账号是否可用，不可用时返回 `400`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"982":{"id":"/docs/api-management-127","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#渠道与账号","content":"没有写 `id` 时自动生成 `<渠道>-<序号>` 形式的 id；`id` 已存在时返回 `409`；渠道不存在时返回 `404`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"983":{"id":"/docs/api-management-128","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#渠道与账号","content":"渠道处于关闭状态时会被重新启用。账号同时写入配置文件和运行中的账号池。","locale":"zh-CN"},"984":{"id":"/docs/api-management-129","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#渠道与账号","content":"`DELETE /providers/{provider_id}/accounts/{account_id}` 从配置文件和运行中的账号池删除账号，返回 `{\"provider\", \"account\", \"removed_from_config\"}`；从旧版数据目录导入、不在 `config.json` 中的账号只从账号池删除，此时 `removed_from_config` 为 `false`。两处都找不到时返回 `404`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"985":{"id":"/docs/api-management-130","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#渠道与账号","content":"`GET /stations` 列出 `agg` 账号可以用 `preset` 指定的站点：`id`、`display_name`、`base_url`、`key_env`（只是告诉你该准备哪个 Key，Hoshimi 不读取这个环境变量）、`catalog_keyless`。见 聚合入口 agg。","locale":"zh-CN"},"986":{"id":"/docs/api-management-131","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#渠道与账号","content":"`GET /channels` 一次返回渠道页需要的全部本地状态，不向上游发请求（余额需要请求上游，所以不在其中，见 `/credits`）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"987":{"id":"/docs/api-management-132","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#渠道与账号","content":"每个渠道：`id`、`display_name`、`enabled`、`keyless`、`configured`、`loginable`、`addable`、`forms`、`models`、`options`、`network`、`diagnostics`、`quota`（被动额度）、`accounts`、`usage_today`、`recent_checkins`（最近 5 次签到结果）和 `status`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"988":{"id":"/docs/api-management-133","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#渠道与账号","content":"`status`：`ok`；`attention`（仍可使用但有需要处理的问题：需要登录、令牌过期、账号被冷却、被限流或额度低于 10%）；`disabled`（被关闭）；`empty`（没有可用的账号）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"989":{"id":"/docs/api-management-134","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#渠道与账号","content":"每个账号：`needs_login`、`refreshable`、`expires_at`（毫秒时间戳）、`failures`、`last_error`、`last_ok`、`cooled_reason`、`cooled_seconds`、`usage_today`、`last_used_at`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"990":{"id":"/docs/api-management-135","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#渠道与账号","content":"顶层还有 `checkin`（每日签到的状态）、`auto_refresh`、`auto_checkin`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"991":{"id":"/docs/api-management-136","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#渠道与账号","content":"`GET /network/diagnostics` 返回每个渠道每类网络操作最近一次的观测：`provider`、`operation`、`kind`（如 `timeout`、`proxy_error`、`connection_error`、`rate_limited`）、`status`、`at`、`host`、`route`。网络设置见网络与代理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"992":{"id":"/docs/api-management-137","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#模型目录","content":"`GET /models` 返回 `levels`（三档输出预算 `light`、`balanced`、`deep`）和 `data`。`data` 的每一项：","locale":"zh-CN"},"993":{"id":"/docs/api-management-138","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#模型目录","content":"字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"994":{"id":"/docs/api-management-139","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#模型目录","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"995":{"id":"/docs/api-management-140","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#模型目录","content":"`id`、`provider`、`name`","locale":"zh-CN"},"996":{"id":"/docs/api-management-141","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#模型目录","content":"模型 id、所属渠道、显示名称","locale":"zh-CN"},"997":{"id":"/docs/api-management-142","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#模型目录","content":"`wire`","locale":"zh-CN"},"998":{"id":"/docs/api-management-143","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#模型目录","content":"上游协议：`chat`、`responses`、`messages` 等","locale":"zh-CN"},"999":{"id":"/docs/api-management-144","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#模型目录","content":"`vision`、`reasoning`、`tools`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1000":{"id":"/docs/api-management-145","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#模型目录","content":"能否看图、是否推理、能否调用工具（`tools` 为 `null` 表示未知）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1001":{"id":"/docs/api-management-146","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#模型目录","content":"`context_window`、`max_output`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1002":{"id":"/docs/api-management-147","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#模型目录","content":"上下文长度和最大输出（`0` 表示未知）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1003":{"id":"/docs/api-management-148","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#模型目录","content":"`can_disable_thinking`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1004":{"id":"/docs/api-management-149","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#模型目录","content":"能否关闭思考","locale":"zh-CN"},"1005":{"id":"/docs/api-management-150","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#模型目录","content":"`region_sensitive`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1006":{"id":"/docs/api-management-151","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#模型目录","content":"可用性是否受地区影响","locale":"zh-CN"},"1007":{"id":"/docs/api-management-152","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#模型目录","content":"`free`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1008":{"id":"/docs/api-management-153","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#模型目录","content":"站点是否声明免费，`null` 表示未说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"1009":{"id":"/docs/api-management-154","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#模型目录","content":"`efforts`、`effort_default`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1010":{"id":"/docs/api-management-155","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#模型目录","content":"推理选项（`id`、`name`、`description`、`is_default`、`tokens`）和默认档位","locale":"zh-CN"},"1011":{"id":"/docs/api-management-156","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#模型目录","content":"`probe`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1012":{"id":"/docs/api-management-157","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#模型目录","content":"最近一次可用性探测的结果，没有探测过时为 `null`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1013":{"id":"/docs/api-management-158","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#模型目录","content":"`unavailable`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1014":{"id":"/docs/api-management-159","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#模型目录","content":"是否被暂时停用（站点对所有账号回答了 404/410）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1015":{"id":"/docs/api-management-160","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#模型目录","content":"`GET /catalog/stream` 是 SSE：先发一个 `snapshot` 事件，列出每个渠道的缓存模型（状态 `loading`）；然后每个渠道刷新完成时发一个 `provider` 事件（状态 `ready`、`failed` 或 20 秒后的 `timeout`，附带 `error`、`last_success`、`retry_at`、`source`）；最后发 `done`。等待期间发送 `: keep-alive` 注释。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1016":{"id":"/docs/api-management-161","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#模型目录","content":"`POST /models/unavailable/reset` 解除所有被暂时停用的模型，返回 `{\"cleared\": <数量>}`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1017":{"id":"/docs/api-management-162","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#可用性探测","content":"`GET /probe` 返回 `running`、`at`（上一轮结束时间）、`results`（模型 → `state`、`detail`、`latency_ms`、`ttft_ms`、`at`）。`state` 为 `available`、`region-blocked`、`unavailable`、`throttled` 或 `unknown`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1018":{"id":"/docs/api-management-163","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#可用性探测","content":"`POST /probe` 在后台开始一轮探测，请求体可选：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1019":{"id":"/docs/api-management-164","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#可用性探测","content":"不写 `models` 或为空数组时，探测所有需要探测的渠道的全部模型。返回同样的快照，另有 `started`（是否真的开始了新一轮；已有一轮在运行时为 `false`，轮次不会叠加）和 `unresolved`（无法解析的模型名）。探测的含义见模型与账号行为。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1020":{"id":"/docs/api-management-165","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#凭据续期","content":"`GET /refresh` 返回 `auto_refresh` 和每个账号的 `provider`、`account`、`refreshable`、`needs_login`、`expires_at`、`failures`、`last_error`、`last_ok`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1021":{"id":"/docs/api-management-166","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#凭据续期","content":"`POST /refresh` 立即续期即将到期的凭据，请求体可选：`{\"provider\": \"<渠道>\", \"force\": true}`（`force` 表示不管是否到期，续期所有可续期的账号）。返回每个账号的结果：`ok`、`persisted`（新凭据已写入配置）、`terminal`（站点拒绝了刷新令牌，需要重新登录）、`error`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1022":{"id":"/docs/api-management-167","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#余额与签到","content":"接口","locale":"zh-CN"},"1023":{"id":"/docs/api-management-168","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#余额与签到","content":"参数","locale":"zh-CN"},"1024":{"id":"/docs/api-management-169","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#余额与签到","content":"返回","locale":"zh-CN"},"1025":{"id":"/docs/api-management-170","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#余额与签到","content":"`GET /credits`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1026":{"id":"/docs/api-management-171","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#余额与签到","content":"`provider`（可选）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1027":{"id":"/docs/api-management-172","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#余额与签到","content":"`rows`（每个账号的 `available`、`unit`、`message`，会请求上游）、`passive`（从正常响应头读到的剩余额度，超过 5 分钟标为 `stale`）、`cooled`（被移出轮换的账号、原因 `rate_limited` 或 `policy_blocked`、剩余秒数）、`checkin`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1028":{"id":"/docs/api-management-173","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#余额与签到","content":"`GET /credits/checkins`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1029":{"id":"/docs/api-management-174","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#余额与签到","content":"`provider`（可选）、`limit`（1–500，默认 50）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1030":{"id":"/docs/api-management-175","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#余额与签到","content":"签到历史，新的在前，包括每日自动签到和手动领取；保留 365 天","locale":"zh-CN"},"1031":{"id":"/docs/api-management-176","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#余额与签到"