api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#用量统计","content":"参数","locale":"zh-CN"},"1041":{"id":"/docs/api-management-186","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#用量统计","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"1042":{"id":"/docs/api-management-187","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#用量统计","content":"`range`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1043":{"id":"/docs/api-management-188","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#用量统计","content":"`24h`、`day`、`7d`（默认）、`30d`、`90d`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1044":{"id":"/docs/api-management-189","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#用量统计","content":"`date`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1045":{"id":"/docs/api-management-190","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#用量统计","content":"`range=day` 时的日期 `YYYY-MM-DD`（服务器本地时间，默认今天）；未来或格式错误的日期返回 `400`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1046":{"id":"/docs/api-management-191","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#用量统计","content":"返回 `totals`、`previous`（紧挨着的前一个同长时段；`day` 为前一天，今天则只比到同一时刻）、`latency`（首 Token 时间和生成速度的平均值、中位数、P95）、补零的 `series`、按模型/渠道/账号/来源的明细、`lifetime`，以及 `since`、`until`（不含）、`date`、`granularity`、`hourly`、`server_time`。`24h` 和 `day` 按小时（夏令时切换的一天为 23 或 25 小时），其余按天；小时数据保留 120 天，按天数据永久保留，没有小时数据的日子 `hourly` 为 `false`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1047":{"id":"/docs/api-management-192","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#用量统计","content":"`GET /stats/days` 返回每个有用量的本地日期（`date`、`calls`、`tokens`、`failed`），从旧到新，以及 `first` 和 `today`，供日历使用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1048":{"id":"/docs/api-management-193","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#用量统计","content":"`GET /stats/calls` 返回逐次调用，新的在前，覆盖整个保留期（`server.stats_keep_days`，默认 90 天）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1049":{"id":"/docs/api-management-194","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#用量统计","content":"参数","locale":"zh-CN"},"1050":{"id":"/docs/api-management-195","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#用量统计","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"1051":{"id":"/docs/api-management-196","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#用量统计","content":"`limit`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1052":{"id":"/docs/api-management-197","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#用量统计","content":"1–200，默认 50","locale":"zh-CN"},"1053":{"id":"/docs/api-management-198","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#用量统计","content":"`before`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1054":{"id":"/docs/api-management-199","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#用量统计","content":"分页游标：上一页返回的 `next`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1055":{"id":"/docs/api-management-200","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#用量统计","content":"`model`、`provider`、`origin`、`ok`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1056":{"id":"/docs/api-management-201","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#用量统计","content":"精确筛选；`origin` 如 `chat`、`responses`、`messages`、`classify`、`playground`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1057":{"id":"/docs/api-management-202","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#用量统计","content":"`account`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1058":{"id":"/docs/api-management-203","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#用量统计","content":"账号 id，或 `渠道/账号`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1059":{"id":"/docs/api-management-204","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#用量统计","content":"`since`、`until`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1060":{"id":"/docs/api-management-205","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#用量统计","content":"ISO 8601 时间（带时区；不带时按服务器本地时间），`until` 不含","locale":"zh-CN"},"1061":{"id":"/docs/api-management-206","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#用量统计","content":"`q`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1062":{"id":"/docs/api-management-207","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#用量统计","content":"在模型、渠道、账号、错误代码、错误消息、结束原因中不区分大小写地搜索","locale":"zh-CN"},"1063":{"id":"/docs/api-management-208","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#用量统计","content":"每条记录包括 `seq`、`at`、`model`、`provider`、`account`、`origin`、`effort`、`stream`、`ok`、各类 Token 数、`ttft_ms`、`tps`、`elapsed_ms`、`attempts`、`finish_reason`、`error_code`、`error_message` 等。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1064":{"id":"/docs/api-management-209","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#用量统计","content":"`GET /stats/calls/{seq}` 返回 `{id, trace}`。`trace` 包含 `client_request`、`client_response`、渠道转换前的 `request`、标准化分块 `response` 和逐次上游通信 `upstream`。HTTP 正文包含 `body`、`encoding`（`utf-8` 或 `base64`）、`bytes` 与 `complete`；客户端返回另有 `finished` 表示采集已结束，即使连接中断而 `complete=false`。历史调用的 `trace` 为 `null`，不存在或已删除的调用返回 404。该接口需要工具访问密钥，模型 API 密钥不能读取它。正文随记录过期或重置时删除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1065":{"id":"/docs/api-management-210","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#用量统计","content":"`DELETE /stats` 清空所有计数和调用记录，返回 `{\"cleared_at\": …}`；正在进行的调用结束时仍会被记录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1066":{"id":"/docs/api-management-211","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#用量统计","content":"`GET /stats/live` 是 SSE，每帧 `data: <json>`：先发一个 `snapshot`（进行中的调用、今日合计、最近的调用），之后是 `started`、`progress`、`finished` 事件；每 15 秒发一次 `ping`。读取太慢跟不上时流会结束，重新连接会得到新的快照。进行中调用的 Token 数是按字符数估算的。用量的记录方式见用量统计。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1067":{"id":"/docs/api-openai","page_id":"/docs/api-op