{"id":"/docs/api-openai-89","page_id":"/docs/api-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-openai#请求字段","content":"助手的工具调用","locale":"zh-CN"},"1158":{"id":"/docs/api-openai-90","page_id":"/docs/api-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-openai#请求字段","content":"`{\"type\": \"function_call_output\", \"call_id\", \"output\"}`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1159":{"id":"/docs/api-openai-91","page_id":"/docs/api-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-openai#请求字段","content":"工具结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"1160":{"id":"/docs/api-openai-92","page_id":"/docs/api-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-openai#请求字段","content":"`{\"type\": \"custom_tool_call\", \"call_id\", \"name\", \"input\"}`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1161":{"id":"/docs/api-openai-93","page_id":"/docs/api-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-openai#请求字段","content":"携带原始文本的助手工具调用","locale":"zh-CN"},"1162":{"id":"/docs/api-openai-94","page_id":"/docs/api-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-openai#请求字段","content":"`{\"type\": \"custom_tool_call_output\", \"call_id\", \"output\"}`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1163":{"id":"/docs/api-openai-95","page_id":"/docs/api-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-openai#请求字段","content":"自定义工具结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"1164":{"id":"/docs/api-openai-96","page_id":"/docs/api-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-openai#请求字段","content":"`{\"type\": \"reasoning\", …}`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1165":{"id":"/docs/api-openai-97","page_id":"/docs/api-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-openai#请求字段","content":"上一轮的推理数据，原样交回上游（带 `provider_details` 时用它）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1166":{"id":"/docs/api-openai-98","page_id":"/docs/api-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-openai#请求字段","content":"把上一轮响应的 `output` 项原样放回 `input`，再追加对应的 `function_call_output` 或 `custom_tool_call_output`，就能延续工具调用和推理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1167":{"id":"/docs/api-openai-99","page_id":"/docs/api-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-openai#请求字段","content":"工具的 `output` 可以是字符串，也可以是包含 `input_text` 和 `input_image` 的数组。文字保留在对应的工具回复中；图片及其 URL、可选的 `detail` 会放在这一组连续工具回复之后的用户消息中，并标注所属调用 ID。这样既能保留 `view_image` 等工具返回的图片，又不会打断并行工具回复的配对；图片数据不会被压成文本。图片识别能力仍取决于选用的上游模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1168":{"id":"/docs/api-openai-100","page_id":"/docs/api-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-openai#请求字段","content":"`apply_patch` 等自定义工具会转换成带有必填字符串字段 `input` 的函数工具发给上游。返回时，Hoshimi 将该字段还原为原始文本，流式事件也采用相同处理。`format` 中的语法作为提示传给模型，Chat 传输不会通过约束解码强制执行该语法。自定义工具的输入会在完整 JSON 参数到达并成功解码后发出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1169":{"id":"/docs/api-openai-101","page_id":"/docs/api-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-openai#请求字段","content":"连续的 assistant 文本、推理和函数调用项会合并为一条 Chat assistant 消息。并行函数调用会放在同一个 `tool_calls` 数组中，后面再接对应的工具结果；工具结果、用户消息或系统消息会结束这一组。这样上游校验 Chat 历史时，每个调用都能与其结果正确配对。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1170":{"id":"/docs/api-openai-102","page_id":"/docs/api-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-openai#请求字段","content":"命名空间中的函数工具会转换为上游 Chat 使用的扁平名称，再在流式和非流式 Responses 调用中还原为准确的 `namespace` 和 `name`。后续 `input` 应保留这些标识；指定工具的 `tool_choice` 也可以携带 `namespace`。过长的传输别名使用稳定哈希缩短到 64 个字符；有歧义的别名会被拒绝。原生 `tool_search` 和 `tool_search_output` 暂不转换：客户端应将发现功能作为普通函数提供，在结果中返回 schema，并把选中的工具加入下一次请求。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1171":{"id":"/docs/api-openai-103","page_id":"/docs/api-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-openai#响应","content":"`output` 中按顺序可能有：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1172":{"id":"/docs/api-openai-104","page_id":"/docs/api-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-openai#响应","content":"`reasoning`：模型有推理内容时出现，`summary` 中是推理文字；上游给出了结构化推理数据时附在 `provider_details` 中，上游本身就是 Responses 协议时直接使用上游的 `reasoning` 项。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1173":{"id":"/docs/api-openai-105","page_id":"/docs/api-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-openai#响应","content":"`message`：回答文字。只有工具调用、没有文字时省略。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1174":{"id":"/docs/api-openai-106","page_id":"/docs/api-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-openai#响应","content":"`function_call`：每个工具调用一项，`call_id`、`name`、`arguments`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1175":{"id":"/docs/api-openai-107","page_id":"/docs/api-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-openai#响应","content":"`custom_tool_call`：每个自定义工具调用一项，包含 `call_id`、`name` 和原始字符串 `input`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1176":{"id":"/docs/api-openai-108","page_id":"/docs/api-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-openai#流式事件","content":"每个事件是一行 `data: {...}`，带 `type` 和从 0 开始递增的 `sequence_number`，最后是 `data: [DONE]`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1177":{"id":"/docs/api-openai-109","page_id":"/docs/api-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-openai#流式事件","content":"事件","locale":"zh-CN"},"1178":{"id":"/docs/api-openai-110","page_id":"/docs/api-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-openai#流式事件","content":"时机","locale":"zh-CN"},"1179":{"id":"/docs/api-openai-111","page_id":"/docs/api-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-openai#流式事件","content":"`response.created`、`response.in_progress`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1180":{"id":"/docs/api-openai-112","page_id":"/docs/api-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-openai#流式事件","content":"开始时","locale":"zh-CN"},"1181":{"id":"/docs/api-openai-113","page_id":"/docs/api-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-openai#流式事件","content":"`response.output_item.added`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1182":{"id":"/docs/api-openai-114","page_id":"/docs/api-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-openai#流式事件","content":"推理、消息或工具调用项开始","locale":"zh-CN"},"1183":{"id":"/docs/api-openai-115","page_id":"/docs/api-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-openai#流式事件","content":"`response.reasoning_summary_text.delta` / `.done`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1184":{"id":"/docs/api-openai-116","page_id":"/docs/api-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-openai#流式事件","content":"推理文字","locale":"zh-CN"},"1185":{"id":"/docs/api-openai-117","page_id":"/docs/api-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-openai#流式事件","content":"`response.output_