骤","content":"工具步骤的 `review` 在审查模型判断之前为 `null`，之后为 `{\"outcome\", \"risk_level\", \"user_authorization\", \"rationale\", \"model\", \"ms\", \"failed\"}`：`outcome` 为 `allow` 或 `deny`，`risk_level` 为 `low`、`medium`、`high` 或 `critical`，`user_authorization` 为 `unknown`、`low`、`medium` 或 `high`，`model` 是审查模型，`ms` 是审查用时。审查无法判断、调用转交给用户时，`failed` 为 `true`，`outcome` 为空，`rationale` 说明原因。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1633":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-368","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#步骤","content":"运行中被停止的调用还会带有 `\"cancelled\": true`。对话再次发给模型时，每一轮会还原为：该轮的补充消息、一条带 `tool_calls` 的 assistant 消息，以及每次调用对应的 `tool` 消息；没有开启工具时，调用及其结果以文字形式发送。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1634":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-369","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#批准","content":"`status` 为 `waiting` 的 `tool` 事件需要答复。用该步骤的 `id` 发送：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1635":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-370","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#批准","content":"`decision`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1636":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-371","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#批准","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"1637":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-372","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#批准","content":"`allow`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1638":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-373","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#批准","content":"运行这次调用","locale":"zh-CN"},"1639":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-374","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#批准","content":"`always`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1640":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-375","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#批准","content":"运行它，并在服务重启前，此对话中同一工具开关的调用不再询问（工作区内和工作区外分开计算）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1641":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-376","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#批准","content":"`deny`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1642":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-377","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#批准","content":"跳过它；模型会被告知用户拒绝了","locale":"zh-CN"},"1643":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-378","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#批准","content":"只有 `waiting` 状态的调用接受答复；`reviewing` 状态的调用由审查模型决定。成功返回 `204`；没有等待中的对应调用时返回 `404`。调用最多等待 10 分钟，之后视为拒绝。随后流中会发送该调用的下一个状态。哪些调用需要等待取决于审批模式（见 Playground 工具）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1644":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-379","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#补充说明","content":"`POST /conversations/{id}/steer`，请求体 `{\"content\": \"...\"}`，向正在进行的回复发送消息而不停止它。返回 `202` 和 `{\"id\": \"steer_…\"}`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1645":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-380","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#补充说明","content":"模型在下一轮开始时（当前调用完成后）读取它；随后流中发送一个 `steer` 事件，其步骤带有这个 `id`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1646":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-381","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#补充说明","content":"在模型收尾时发送的消息会让回复再继续一轮来回应它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1647":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-382","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#补充说明","content":"没有回复能接收时返回 `409`：没有回复在运行、运行中的回复没有工具，或回复刚刚结束。此时请把它作为新消息发送。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1648":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-383","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#补充说明","content":"消息为空时返回 `400`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1649":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-384","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#补充说明","content":"回复停止或失败时仍在排队的消息不会被读取。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1650":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-385","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#后台命令","content":"`GET /conversations/{id}/terminals` 列出该对话的工具启动的后台命令（`exec_command` 会话），包括仍在运行的，以及已退出但模型尚未读取其输出的：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1651":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-386","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#后台命令","content":"`DELETE /conversations/{id}/terminals/{session_id}` 停止其中一个及其启动的所有进程（`204`；不属于该对话时返回 `404`）。删除对话或服务停止时，它们也会停止。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1652":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-387","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#附件","content":"先上传文件，再把它的 `id` 放进 `attachment_ids` 发送。请求体就是文件本身：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1653":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-388","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#附件","content":"查询参数","locale":"zh-CN"},"1654":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-389","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#附件","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"1655":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-390","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#附件","content":"`name`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1656":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-391","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#附件","content":"文件名（必填）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1657":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-392","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#附件","content":"`type`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1658":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-393","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#附件","content":"请求体为提取出的文字时，文件本来的类型（网页界面发送 PDF 文字时使用 `type=application/pdf`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1659":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-394","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#附件","content":"`width`、`height`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1660":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-395","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#附件","content":"图片尺寸，可选","locale":"zh-CN"},"1661":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-396","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#附件","content":"`Content-Type` 决定保存方式：`image/png`、`image/jpeg`、`image/webp` 或 `image/gif` 作为图片保存；任意 `text/*` 类型，或 `application/json`、`xml`、`yaml`、`x-yaml`、`javascript`、`x-sh`、`sql`、`toml`，作为 UTF-8 文本保存。其他类型或空请求体返回 `400`。服务端按收到的内容保存：缩小图片和提取 PDF 文字都由网页界面在上传前完成。文件文字发给模型时最多 200,000 个字符。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1662":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-397","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#附件","content":"响应为附件对象：`id`、`kind`、`name`、`mime`、`size`、`width`、`height`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1663":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-398","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#附件","content":"`GET /attachments/{id}` 按图片自身的类型返回图片，文件以 `text/plain` 返回。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1664":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-399","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#附件","content":"`DELETE /attachments/{id}` 在发送前撤回附件（`204`）；已被消息携带的附件返回 `400`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1665":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-400","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#附件","content":"从未发送的附件会在一天后删除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1666":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-401","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#上下文与压缩","content":"`GET /conversations/{id}/context` 返回屏幕上的对话相对于模型上下文窗口的占用情况：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1667":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-402","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#上下文与压缩","content":"字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"1668":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-403","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#上下文与压缩","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"1669":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-404","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#上下文与压缩","content":"`model`、`provider`、`effort`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1670":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-405","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#上下文与压缩","content":"对话的模型与推理强度","locale":"zh-CN"},"1671":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-406","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#上下文与压缩","content":"`window`、`window_source`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1672":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-407","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#上下文与压缩","content":"模型窗口的 token 数：来自模型列表（`catalog`）、假定值（`default`），或站点拒绝更长请求时给出的数值（`learned`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1673":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-408","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#上下文与压缩","content":"`limit`、`headroom`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1674":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-409","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#上下文与压缩","content":"压缩阈值，以及为回复预留的空间","locale":"zh-CN"},"1675":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-410","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#上下文与压缩","content":"`used`、`used_source`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1676":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-411","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#上下文与压缩","content":"下一个请求的占用：按站点对上次回复的统计（`usage`），或估算（`estimate`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1677":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-412","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#上下文与压缩","content":"`last`、`totals`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1678":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-413","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#上下文与压缩","content":"最后一次统计到的轮次，以及路径上所有回复的 token：`input`、`cached`、`output`、`reasoning`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1679":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-414","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#上下文与压缩","content":"`rounds`、`replies`、`compactions`、`last_compaction`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1680":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-415","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#上下文与压缩","content":"路径上的计数；最近一次压缩的 `tokens_before`、`tokens_after`、`at`、`trigger`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1681":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-416","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#上下文与压缩","content":"`last_duration_ms`、`total_duration_ms`、`running_since`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1682":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-417","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#上下文与压缩","content":"回复的工作时长；有回复运行时为其开始时间（Unix 秒），否则为 `null`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1683":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-418","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#上下文与压缩","content":"`auto_compact`、`tools`、`approval`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1684":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-419","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#上下文与压缩","content":"`playground.auto_compact`、开启的工具、生效的批准模式","locale":"zh-CN"},"1685":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-420","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#上下文与压缩","content":"`POST /conversations/{id}/compact` 立即压缩对话，可附带 `instructions`（总结应关注的内容）。它依次推送 `checkpoint`（保存后的检查点消息，步骤状态为 `running`）和 `done`（最终保存的结果）。`done` 的 `status` 为 `error` 表示失败，对话保持原样；断开连接也会同样停止。有回复正在运行时返回 `409`，没有可压缩的内容（上次压缩后没有新回复）时返回 `400`。下一个问题以检查点的 ID 作为 `parent_id` 发送。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1686":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-421","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#上下文与压缩","content":"回复也会自行压缩对话（回复开始时、两轮工具调用之间，以及站点以过长为由拒绝某一轮时），表现为 `compaction` 事件和 `compaction` 步骤。从压缩点起，模型收到的是此前全部内容的总结（作为一条用户消息，后接一条确认），**复制为 API 请求** 可以看到。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1687":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-422","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#标题分支请求与会话","content":"`POST /conversations/{id}/title` 让模型根据第一轮问答为对话命名，并等待模型完成。使用 `playground.title_model`，未设置则用对话自身的模型。临时对话、已由模型命名的对话和你自己设置了标题的对话保持不变；模型调用失败时标题也不变。返回对话摘要。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1688":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-423","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#标题分支请求与会话","content":"`POST /conversations/{id}/branch`，请求体 `{\"message_id\": \"...\"}`，新建一个对话，包含截至该消息的路径（使用新的 ID），沿用标题、模型、推理强度和审批模式，并设置 `branched_from`。返回 `201` 和完整对话。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1689":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-424","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#标题分支请求与会话","content":"`GET /conversations/{id}/messages/{message_id}/request` 返回某条回复背后的 Chat Completions 请求体（对问题则是将用来回答它的请求）：`model`、`messages`、`stream: true`，设置了推理强度时有 `reasoning_effort`，开启了工具时有 `tools` 和 `tool_choice`。使用了工具的回复返回的是第一轮的请求。这就是网页界面的 **复制为 API 请求**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1690":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-425","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#标题分支请求与会话","content":"`GET /session` 返回 `{\"conversation_id\": \"...\"}`，即上次打开的对话（没有，或该对话是临时对话或已删除时为 `null`）。`PUT /session` 用同样的请求体设置它（新对话时为 `null`）；ID 不存在时返回 `400`。网页界面启动时会重新打开它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1691":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-426","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#一次性聊天与模型列表","content":"`POST /chat/completions` 接受 OpenAI Chat Completions 请求（见 OpenAI 兼容 API），响应与 `/v1/chat/completions` 相同，但使用工具访问密钥而不是模型 API 密钥，并以 `playground` 来源记录在用量中。请求中没有 `system` 或 `developer` 消息时，先发送 `playground.system_prompt`。不会保存为对话。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1692":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-427","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#一次性聊天与模型列表","content":"`GET /models` 返回与 `GET /v1/models` 相同的列表。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1693":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-428","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#一次性聊天与模型列表","content":"通过对话生成的回复、标题和图片描述分别以 `playground`、`playground-title` 和 `playground-vision` 来源记录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1694":{"id":"/docs/api","page_id":"/docs/api","type":"page","content":"API 概览","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","API 参考"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/api","locale":"zh-CN"},"1695":{"id":"/docs/api-0","page_id":"/docs/api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api","content":"Hoshimi 的 HTTP 接口全貌：模型接口、管理接口和 Playground 接口各在哪里、用哪把密钥，请求检查与错误格式，流式响应的约定，以及运行中服务器的 /docs 和 /openapi.json。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1696":{"id":"/docs/api-1","page_id":"/docs/api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api#接口分组","content":"接口分组","locale":"zh-CN"},"1697":{"id":"/docs/api-2","page_id":"/docs/api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api#认证","content":"认证","locale":"zh-CN"},"1698":{"id":"/docs/api-3","page_id":"/docs/api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api#请求检查","content":"请求检查","locale":"zh-CN"},"1699":{"id":"/docs/api-4","page_id":"/docs/api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api#错误格式","content":"错误格式","locale":"zh-CN"},"1700":{"id":"/docs/api-5","page_id":"/docs/api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api#流式响应","content":"流式响应","locale":"zh-CN"},"1701":{"id":"/docs/api-6","page_id":"/docs/api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api#接口文档docs-与-openapijson","content":"接口文档：/docs 与 /openapi.json","locale":"zh-CN"},"1702":{"id":"/docs/api-7","page_id":"/docs/api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api","content":"Hoshimi 的服务器同时提供三组接口和网页界面，默认地址是 `http://127.0.0.1:10600`。本页说明它们共同的规则；每组接口的字段见各自的参考页。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1703":{"id":"/docs/api-8","page_id":"/docs/api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api#接口分组","content":"分组","locale":"zh-CN"},"1704":{"id":"/docs/api-9","page_id":"/docs/api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api#接口分组","content":"路径","locale":"zh-CN"},"1705":{"id":"/docs/api-10","page_id":"/docs/api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api#接口分组","content":"密钥","locale":"zh-CN"},"1706":{"id":"/docs/api-11","page_id":"/docs/api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api#接口分组","content":"参考","locale":"zh-CN"},"1707":{"id":"/docs/api-12","page_id":"/docs/api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api#接口分组","content":