","content":"两种云平台的认证方式交给官方 SDK，由 SDK 按它自己的规则读取环境变量：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2110":{"id":"/docs/cli-env-70","page_id":"/docs/cli-env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-env#云-sdk-读取的变量","content":"**Vertex，`auth: \"adc\"`**：Google 的应用默认凭据（ADC），例如 `GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS` 指向的服务账户文件。需要 `hoshimi[google]`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2111":{"id":"/docs/cli-env-71","page_id":"/docs/cli-env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-env#云-sdk-读取的变量","content":"**Amazon Bedrock，AWS 默认凭据**（账户里没有写访问密钥或 profile 时）：AWS SDK 的默认凭据链，例如 `AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID`、`AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY`、`AWS_PROFILE` 和共享配置文件。需要 `hoshimi[bedrock]`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2112":{"id":"/docs/cli-env-72","page_id":"/docs/cli-env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-env#云-sdk-读取的变量","content":"这些变量必须出现在启动 Hoshimi 的进程的环境里，以系统服务运行时尤其要注意。账户写法见云平台。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2113":{"id":"/docs/cli-env-73","page_id":"/docs/cli-env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-env#playground-工具运行命令时设置的变量","content":"Playground 的 **运行命令** 和 **后台命令** 工具在服务器进程的环境基础上，额外设置下面这些变量，让命令输出适合模型阅读、不会停下来等待输入：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2114":{"id":"/docs/cli-env-74","page_id":"/docs/cli-env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-env#playground-工具运行命令时设置的变量","content":"变量","locale":"zh-CN"},"2115":{"id":"/docs/cli-env-75","page_id":"/docs/cli-env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-env#playground-工具运行命令时设置的变量","content":"值","locale":"zh-CN"},"2116":{"id":"/docs/cli-env-76","page_id":"/docs/cli-env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-env#playground-工具运行命令时设置的变量","content":"目的","locale":"zh-CN"},"2117":{"id":"/docs/cli-env-77","page_id":"/docs/cli-env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-env#playground-工具运行命令时设置的变量","content":"`PAGER`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2118":{"id":"/docs/cli-env-78","page_id":"/docs/cli-env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-env#playground-工具运行命令时设置的变量","content":"`cat`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2119":{"id":"/docs/cli-env-79","page_id":"/docs/cli-env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-env#playground