config-network#三种模式","content":"`direct`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2506":{"id":"/docs/config-network-18","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#三种模式","content":"始终直连，忽略环境变量","locale":"zh-CN"},"2507":{"id":"/docs/config-network-19","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#三种模式","content":"`proxy`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2508":{"id":"/docs/config-network-20","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#三种模式","content":"始终经过 `proxy` 中的代理","locale":"zh-CN"},"2509":{"id":"/docs/config-network-21","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#三种模式","content":"`inherit`（仅渠道）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2510":{"id":"/docs/config-network-22","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#三种模式","content":"使用全局策略，这是渠道的默认值","locale":"zh-CN"},"2511":{"id":"/docs/config-network-23","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#三种模式","content":"两条规则不受模式影响：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2512":{"id":"/docs/config-network-24","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#三种模式","content":"目标是本机（`localhost`、`*.localhost`、`127.0.0.0/8`、`::1`）的请求始终直连，所以本地模型服务不会被发到代理上。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2513":{"id":"/docs/config-network-25","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#三种模式","content":"配置了代理却连不上时，请求直接失败，**不会**退回直连。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2514":{"id":"/docs/config-network-26","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#设置全局策略","content":"在网页界面的 **设置** › **网络** 中选择 **自动（环境代理）**、**直连** 或 **指定代理**，填写 **代理地址** 后保存。也可以写在 `config.json` 里：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2515":{"id":"/docs/config-network-27","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#设置全局策略","content":"用命令行时，把整个对象一次写入（单独写 `network.mode proxy` 会因缺少代理地址被拒绝），然后重启服务器：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2516":{"id":"/docs/config-network-28","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#设置全局策略","content":"代理地址的要求：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2517":{"id":"/docs/config-network-29","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#设置全局策略","content":"协议是 `http`、`https`、`socks5` 或 `socks5h`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2518":{"id":"/docs/config-network-30","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#设置全局策略","content":"有主机名，不带路径、查询参数或片段（结尾的 `/` 可以）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2519":{"id":"/docs/config-network-31","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#设置全局策略","content":"可以包含用户名和密码，如 `http://user:pass@proxy.example.com:8080`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2520":{"id":"/docs/config-network-32","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#设置全局策略","content":"代理地址可能含有密码。它明文保存在本地的 `config.json` 中；设置接口只返回“是否已配置”，`hoshimi config show` 显示为 `***`，网页上显示 **已配置代理，保存可替换。** 在网页上清空代理地址并保存，会回到自动模式（渠道则回到继承）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2521":{"id":"/docs/config-network-33","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#环境变量auto-模式","content":"`auto` 模式按目标地址的协议选择代理：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2522":{"id":"/docs/config-network-34","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#环境变量auto-模式","content":"`https://` 目标用 `HTTPS_PROXY`，`http://` 目标用 `HTTP_PROXY`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2523":{"id":"/docs/config-network-35","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#环境变量auto-模式","content":"对应的变量为空时用 `ALL_PROXY`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2524":{"id":"/docs/config-network-36","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#环境变量auto-模式","content":"目标命中 `NO_PROXY` 时直连。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2525":{"id":"/docs/config-network-37","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#环境变量auto-模式","content":"每个变量都是小写形式优先（`https_proxy` 优先于 `HTTPS_PROXY`）。环境变量里的代理地址同样会被校验，写错时请求会报错，而不是被悄悄忽略。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2526":{"id":"/docs/config-network-38","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#环境变量auto-模式","content":"`NO_PROXY` 用逗号（或分号）分隔，每一项可以是：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2527":{"id":"/docs/config-network-39","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#环境变量auto-模式","content":"写法","locale":"zh-CN"},"2528":{"id":"/docs/config-network-40","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#环境变量auto-模式","content":"匹配","locale":"zh-CN"},"2529":{"id":"/docs/config-network-41","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#环境变量auto-模式","content":"`example.com`、`.example.com`、`*.example.com`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2530":{"id":"/docs/config-network-42","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#环境变量auto-模式","content":"这个域名及其所有子域名","locale":"zh-CN"},"2531":{"id":"/docs/config-network-43","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#环境变量auto-模式","content":"`example.com:8443`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2532":{"id":"/docs/config-network-44","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#环境变量auto-模式","content":"这个域名的指定端口","locale":"zh-CN"},"2533":{"id":"/docs/config-network-45","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#环境变量auto-模式","content":"`10.0.0.0/8`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2534":{"id":"/docs/config-network-46","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#环境变量auto-模式","content":"落在这个网段里的 IP 地址目标","locale":"zh-CN"},"2535":{"id":"/docs/config-network-47","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#环境变量auto-模式","content":"`*`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2536":{"id":"/docs/config-network