rl":"/docs/config-paths#日志","content":"作为系统服务运行时，日志由服务管理器收集（如 `journalctl`），见安装。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2714":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-72","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#移动配置文件","content":"旧版本的 `--config` 参数和 `HOSHIMI_CONFIG` 环境变量已经移除，当前工作目录下的 `config.json` 既不会被读取，也不会被自动迁移。升级后先运行：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2715":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-73","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#移动配置文件","content":"在启动新版本之前，把旧的配置文件移动到它打印的位置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2716":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-74","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#让旧的-json-记录自动导入","content":"更早的版本把用量、签到和探测结果分别存在 `stats.json`、`checkin.json` 和 `probe.json` 中。升级后第一次启动时，这三个文件会被导入 `hoshimi.db`，然后改名为 `*.migrated`。无法读取的文件改名为 `*.corrupt`，对应的记录从空开始。数据库里已经有这类记录时不会再次导入。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2717":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-75","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#确认","content":"检查配置能否读取，并列出将要启用的渠道和账号数量。确认无误后可以删除 `*.migrated` 文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2718":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-76","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#备份与重置","content":"要做的事","locale":"zh-CN"},"2719":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-77","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#备份与重置","content":"方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"2720":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-78","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#备份与重置","content":"完整备份","locale":"zh-CN"},"2721":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-79","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#备份与重置","content":"停止服务器，复制整个数据目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"2722":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-80","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#备份与重置","content":"搬到另一台机器","locale":"zh-CN"},"2723":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-81","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#备份与重置","content":"复制数据目录，在新机器上用 `HOSHIMI_DATA_DIR` 指向它（或放到默认位置）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2724":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-82","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#备份与重置","content":"只清空用量统计","locale":"zh-CN"},"2725":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-83","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#备份与重置","content":"网页 **用量** 页的 **重置统计**，或 `DELETE /api/v1/stats`。不可撤销","locale":"zh-CN"},"2726":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-84","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#备份与重置","content":"丢弃所有记录","locale":"zh-CN"},"2727":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-85","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#备份与重置","content":"停止服务器，删除 `hoshimi.db`（以及同名的 `-wal`、`-shm` 文件）。配置和账号不受影响","locale":"zh-CN"},"2728":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-86","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#备份与重置","content":"丢弃缓存的模型目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"2729":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-87","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#备份与重置","content":"删除 `catalog-cache/`，下次启动时重新拉取","locale":"zh-CN"},"2730":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-88","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#备份与重置","content":"恢复默认设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"2731":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-89","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#备份与重置","content":"停止服务器，把 `config.json` 改名。注意渠道账号也在这个文件里，会一并消失","locale":"zh-CN"},"2732":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-90","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#备份与重置","content":"运行中的服务器会把内存中的配置写回 `config.json`，并持续写入数据库。在它运行时删除或替换这些文件，改动可能被覆盖或丢失。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2733":{"id":"/docs/config-security","page_id":"/docs/config-security","type":"page","content":"访问控制","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","配置"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/config-security","locale":"zh-CN"},"2734":{"id":"/docs/config-security-0","page