docs/development-architecture-148","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#中间件与路由","content":"`SecurityMiddleware` 先检查 `Host`、来源、客户端地址和模型 API 密钥。路由函数很薄：解析请求体，调用 `core`，把结果变成响应。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3269":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-149","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#准备请求","content":"`hoshimi/api/inference.py` 的 `prepare_request` 在请求没有 `model` 时填入默认模型（`server.default_model`，或渠道池的默认模型），都没有时以 `ValidationError` 拒绝；它还为请求设置一个 `prompt_cache_key`（请求自己带了就不覆盖）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3270":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-150","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#计入用量","content":"`tracked_chunks` 在调用渠道之前就打开一次用量记录（`stats.turn`），所以连路由失败的请求也会被记录。推理强度按请求实际携带的级别记录；回答请求的账号由渠道池在第一个分片到达时报告（`on_route`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3271":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-151","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#路由到渠道","content":"`Registry.resolve` 把模型名解析成渠道和上游模型名：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3272":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-152","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#路由到渠道","content":"`provider/model` 形式且前缀是一个启用的渠道：直接使用该渠道。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3273":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-153","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#路由到渠道","content":"不带前缀的模型名：按渠道顺序（`PROVIDER_ORDER`）找第一个目录里有它的渠道。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3274":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-154","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#路由到渠道","content":"没有任何目录包含它、但只启用了一个渠道：原样转给这个渠道。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3275":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-155","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#路由到渠道","content":"否则返回 `model_not_found`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3276":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-156","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#路由到渠道","content":"`Registry.stream` 随后应用推理强度策略（把级别换成该模型在线路上的写法），并检查失效模型记录：某个模型被所有账号回答 404/410 后会被暂时记下，在此期间请求直接以 `model_unavailable`（503）拒绝，而不是再问一次上游。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3277":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-157","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#账号轮换与上游协议","content":"`Provider.stream_using` 依次尝试渠道的账号：认证失败先续期再换账号，额度用尽的账号冷却一段时间，模型过载时立即停止。选中的账号通过 `stream_raw` 用上游自己的协议发出请求，并把上游的流转换成**归一化分片**。细节见渠道适配器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3278":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-158","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#输出公开协议","content":"`emit_chat_chunks` 把归一化分片变成 `chat.completion.chunk`，路由把它们写成 SSE 帧，最后发送 `data: [DONE]`。响应头发出之后的失败变成一个错误帧，而不是 500。`stream: false` 时，`aggregate_chat` 把同样的分片折叠成一个 `chat.completion`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3279":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-159","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#输出公开协议","content":"其他协议共用这条路径，只有两端不同：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3280":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-160","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#输出公开协议","content":"端点","locale":"zh-CN"},"3281":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-161","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#输出公开协议","content":"进入时","locale":"zh-CN"},"3282":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-162","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#输出公开协议","content":"输出时","locale":"zh-CN"},"3283":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-163","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"ty