lopment-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#输出公开协议","content":"Messages 的流式响应在上游思考期间每 15 秒发送一次 `event: ping`，客户端断开时关闭上游连接（`hoshimi/api/heartbeat.py`）。Playground 的对话走的也是同一条路由和计量路径，只是用量记录的来源不同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3293":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-173","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#命令行","content":"`hoshimi/cli/app.py` 的 `get_app()` 是注册命令的唯一位置；每个命令的实现在 `hoshimi/cli/commands/`。Typer 的私有导入（`typer._click`）只出现在 `hoshimi/cli/factory.py`，Typer 的版本变化先在这里、在命令行测试里暴露。所有命令都有 `--debug` 选项，打开调试日志。`python -m hoshimi` 与 `hoshimi` 命令等价。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3294":{"id":"/docs/development-providers","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","type":"page","content":"渠道适配器","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-providers","locale":"zh-CN"},"3295":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-0","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers","content":"怎样接入一个渠道：Provider 契约、归一化的流式分片协议、错误分类与账号轮换、模型目录与能力，以及交互式登录流程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3296":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-1","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-providers#渠道的几种形式","content":"渠道的几种形式","locale":"zh-CN"},"3297":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-2","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-providers#provider-契约","content":"Provider 契约","locale":"zh-CN"},"3298":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-3","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-providers#类属性","content":"类属性","locale":"zh-CN"},"3299":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-4","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-providers#方法","content":"方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"3300":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-5","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","type":"heading","tags":[],"ur