e":"zh-CN"},"3675":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-24","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#仓库布局","content":"`generate_openapi.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3676":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-25","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#仓库布局","content":"在标准输出打印 OpenAPI 文档，供 Web UI 生成类型","locale":"zh-CN"},"3677":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-26","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#仓库布局","content":"`generate_provider_inventory.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3678":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-27","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#仓库布局","content":"生成渠道来源清单页面","locale":"zh-CN"},"3679":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-28","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#仓库布局","content":"`check_layout.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3680":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-29","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#仓库布局","content":"在真实浏览器里检查 Web UI 有没有横向溢出，见测试","locale":"zh-CN"},"3681":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-30","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#克隆并建立虚拟环境","content":"Hoshimi 支持 Python 3.10 及以上；CI 的 lint 与构建使用 3.11。`.venv/` 已在 `.gitignore` 中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3682":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-31","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#以可编辑方式安装带上开发依赖","content":"`dev` 附加依赖包含 pytest、Ruff、ty、build 和官方 Anthropic SDK（Messages 的回归测试用到它）。要覆盖云渠道的代码，再加上 `google`（`google-auth[requests]`）和 `bedrock`（`boto3`）：CI 的类型检查和测试安装的就是 `.[dev,google,bedrock]`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3683":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-32","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#确认环境","content":"`dev.py` 用运行它的解释器（`sys.executable`）调用 Ruff、ty 和 pytest，而不是 `PATH` 上的那个，所以用虚拟环境里的 `python` 运行它即可。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3684":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-33","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#web-uibun","content":"Web UI（`hoshimi/webui/`）和文档站（`site/`）都用 bun 安装、构建和测试；CI 使用 bun 1.4.2。`dev.py` 在 `PATH` 上找不到 `bun` 时给出一行说明并以状态 127 退出，而不是抛出回溯。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3685":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-34","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#web-uibun","content":"构建好的 `dist/` 作为包数据随 wheel 发布。在源码目录里运行 `hoshimi serve` 时，若没有 `dist/index.html`，服务器记录一条警告，只提供 API。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3686":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-35","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#开发模式api-与-vite-一起运行","content":"它同时启动两个进程，并给每一行输出加上进程名（`api` 或 `web`）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3687":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-36","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#开发模式api-与-vite-一起运行","content":"**API**：`python -m hoshimi serve --no-open --no-ui --port 10600 --strict-port`，仓库根目录放在 `PYTHONPATH` 最前面，所以运行的是工作区里的代码。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3688":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-37","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#开发模式api-与-vite-一起运行","content":"**Vite**：在 `hoshimi/webui` 中运行 `bun run dev --port 5173 --strictPort`，并设置 `HOSHIMI_BACKEND=http://127.0.0.1:10600`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3689":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-38","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#开发模式api-与-vite-一起运行","content":"浏览器只需打开 `http://localhost:5173`：Vite 把 `/api`、`/v1`、`/health`、`/openapi.json`、`/docs` 和 `/redoc` 代理给 API，所以界面和模型 API 都在这一个地址上。界面的改动就地热更新；Python 的改动需要重新运行这个任务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3690":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-39","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#开发模式api-与-vite-一起运行","content":"选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"3691":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-40","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#开发模式api-与-vite-一起运行","content":"默认值","locale":"zh-CN"},"3692":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-41","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#开发模式api-与-vite-一起运行","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"3693":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-42","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#开发模式api-与-vite-一起运行","content":"`--api-port`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3694":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-43","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#开发模式api-与-vite-一起运行","content":"`10600`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3695":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-44","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#开发模式api-与-vite-一起运行","content":"API 服务器的端口","locale":"zh-CN"},"3696":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-45","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#开发模式api-与-vite-一起运行","content":"`--web-port`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3697":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-46","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#开发模式api-与-vite-一起运行","content":"`5173`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3698":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-47","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#开发模式api-与-vite-一起运行","content":"Vite 的端口","locale":"zh-CN"},"3699":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-48","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#开发模式api-与-vite-一起运行","content":"Ctrl+C 同时停止两个进程；其中一个退出时，另一个也被停止，任务以它的退出状态结束。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3700":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-49","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#开发模式api-与-vite-一起运行","content":"还没有安装 Web UI 依赖时，任务提示先运行 `python scripts/dev.py web-install`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3701":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-50","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#开发模式api-与-vite-一起运行","content":"API 重启期间，Vite 的代理最多每 5 秒打印一行“API 没有响应”，并以 HTTP 502 和 `{\"code\": \"api_unreachable\", ...}` 回答请求，而不是刷出一屏连接错误。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3702":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-51","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#用单独的数据目录","content":"开发时的配置、账号和用量记录与平时的数据分开，只需设置 `HOSHIMI_DATA_DIR`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3703":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-52","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#用单独的数据目录","content":"数据目录的其他内容见路径与数据目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3704":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-53","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#只运行界面","content":"API 已经在别处运行时，`python scripts/dev.py web-dev` 只启动 Vite。它默认代理到 `http://127.0.0.1:10600`；API 在其他地址时，先把环境变量 `HOSHIMI_BACKEND` 设为那个地址（例如 `http://127.0.0.1:10601`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3705":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-54","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"不带参数运行 `python scripts/dev.py` 列出全部任务。可以一次写多个任务，按顺序运行，遇到第一个失败就停止。任务名之后从第一个以 `-` 开头的参数起，都交给该任务；带选项时只能运行一个任务，不接受选项的任务收到选项时以状态 2 失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3706":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-55","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"任务","locale":"zh-CN"},"3707":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-56","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"3708":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-57","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`lint`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3709":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-58","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url"