Transport` 构造适配器的客户端，检查请求的地址、头和体，以及 `stream_raw` 产出的分片类型。例子见渠道适配器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3922":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-71","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#常用写法","content":"**Anthropic Messages**：`tests/api/test_native_messages.py` 用官方 Anthropic SDK（`dev` 附加依赖中）的 JSON 与流式辅助函数访问网关，上游是本地的模拟传输，所以不需要真实凭据。`tests/api/test_messages_heartbeat.py` 单独检查心跳的时机、心跳不会切开完整的 SSE 帧，以及客户端断开时释放上游。用真实的 Claude Code 试用一个已配置的网关，见 Claude Code。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3923":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-72","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#常用写法","content":"**只在 POSIX 上运行的测试**：Playground 的 shell 与后台命令测试在 Windows 上跳过（`pytest.mark.skipif(os.name == \"nt\", ...)`）；需要切换本地时区的用量测试在没有 `time.tzset` 的平台上跳过。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3924":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-73","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#常用写法","content":"**自己的 Services**：需要特定设置时调用 `make_services(default_model=..., ...)`；需要多个渠道时传入额外的 `FakeProvider` 或子类。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3925":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-74","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#web-ui-测试","content":"在 `hoshimi/webui` 中，`bun run test` 运行 Vitest，`bun run typecheck` 运行 vue-tsc；`python scripts/dev.py test-web` 依次运行两者。测试环境是 happy-dom，`src/test/setup.ts` 补上 `@material/web` 需要的 `ElementInternals`，`src/test/motion-zero.css` 把所有动效时长设为 0，测试永远不必等待过渡。Vitest 用 `vmThreads` 池运行（Windows 上工作线程会争抢创建临时目录）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3926":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-75","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#web-ui-测试","content":"测试和被测文件放在一起（`*.test.ts`）。除了组件、仓库和查询的测试，有几组测试检查的是全局规则：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3927":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-76","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#web-ui-测试","content":"测试","locale":"zh-CN"},"392