uide-channels-136","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#额度","content":"格式不对的响应头计为“额度表头无法解析”。额度读数只保存在内存中，界面只显示响应头的名称，不显示其原始值。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4638":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-137","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#网络","content":"每个渠道可以有自己的网络线路，覆盖 **设置 › 网络** 中的全局设置。在 **请求出口** 中选择：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4639":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-138","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#网络","content":"选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"4640":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-139","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#网络","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"4641":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-140","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#网络","content":"**继承全局配置**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4642":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-141","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#网络","content":"默认，使用 **设置 › 网络** 的设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"4643":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-142","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#网络","content":"**自动（环境代理）**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4644":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-143","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#网络","content":"读取 `HTTP_PROXY`、`HTTPS_PROXY`、`ALL_PROXY` 和 `NO_PROXY` 环境变量；此时还可以打开 **无环境代理时使用 Windows 系统代理**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4645":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-144","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#网络","content":"**直连**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4646":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-145","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#网络","content":"不使用任何代理","locale":"zh-CN"},"4647":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-146","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#网络","content":"**指定代理**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4648":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-147","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#网络","content":"在 **代理地址** 中填写 HTTP(S) 或 SOCKS5 地址后点 **保存**；**清空** 回到继承","locale":"zh-CN"},"4649":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-148","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#网络","content":"这条线路覆盖网关为这个渠道发出的所有请求：模型目录、推理、登录、令牌刷新、余额查询和签到。代理地址保存后只显示 **已配置代理，保存可替换。**，不会再显示出来。指定的代理连不上时不会退回直连。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4650":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-149","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#网络","content":"这一部分下方还会列出这个渠道最近失败的网络操作：操作（如 **模型目录**、**推理请求**、**令牌刷新**、**签到**）、失败类型（如 **连接超时**、**代理连接失败**、**地区限制**、**需要浏览器授权**）、HTTP 状态码和时间；悬停可以看到目标主机和所用的线路。成功的操作不列出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4651":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-150","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#网络","content":"网络设置的完整说明见网络与代理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4652":{"id":"/docs/guide-models","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","type":"page","content":"模型","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","使用教程"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-models","locale":"zh-CN"},"4653":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-0","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models","content":"模型页：浏览所有可调用的模型，查看能力、上下文长度和免费标记，运行可用性探测，复制模型 id 或在 Playground 中试用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4654":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-1","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-models#模型列表","content":"模型列表","locale":"zh-CN"},"4655":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-2","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-models#搜索与筛选","content":"搜索与筛选","locale":"zh-CN"},"4656":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-3","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-models#目录如何加载","content":"目录如何加载","locale":"zh-CN"},"4657":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-4","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-models#可用性探测","content":"可用性探测","locale":"zh-CN"},"4658":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-5","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-models#网关记住的故障","content":"网关记住的故障","locale":"zh-CN"},"4659":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-6","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-models#复制-id-与试用","content":"复制 id 与试用","locale":"zh-CN"},"4660":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-7","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-models#列表为空时","content":"列表为空时","locale":"zh-CN"},"4661":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-8","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models","content":"**模型** 页列出网关此刻能回答的每一个模型 id，也就是客户端在请求的 `model` 字段中可以填写的值。模型来自所有已启用的渠道：各站点自己公布的模型列表，加上渠道和账号配置中声明的模型。想让某个模型出现在这里，先在渠道页给它的提供商登录或添加账号。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4662":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-9","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型列表","content":"标题下方显示模型总数；做过探测后，还显示其中 **可用** 的数量（**N 个模型 · N 个可用**）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4663":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-10","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型列表","content":"列","locale":"zh-CN"},"4664":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-11","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型列表","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"4665":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-12","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型列表","content":"**模型 id**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4666":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-13","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型列表","content":"请求中使用的 id。下面一行是站点给出的显示名称（与 id 不同时），站点明确说明免费时加上 **免费**。id 太长时截断，悬停可看完整 id","locale":"zh-CN"},"4667":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-14","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型列表","content":"**提供商**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4668":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-15","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型列表","content":"模型来自哪个渠道","locale":"zh-CN"},"4669":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-16","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型列表","content":"**上下文**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4670":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-17","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型列表","content":"上下文窗口，以 K（1024 个 Token）为单位；不知道时显示 —","locale":"zh-CN"},"4671":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-18","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型列表","content":"**能力**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4672":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-19","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型列表","content":"三个小图标：**推理**（悬停时显示可选的推理强度档位数，如 **推理 · 3 档位**）、**视觉**（能读取图片）、**工具调用**。站点明确说明不支持工具时显示 **不支持工具调用**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4673":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-20","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型列表","content":"**可用性**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4674":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-21","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型列表","content":"最近一次探测的结论，见下文；从未探测过的模型显示 **未探测**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4675":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-22","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型列表","content":"点 **模型 id**、**提供商**、**上下文**、**可用性** 的列标题可以排序。窗口较窄时，**上下文**、**提供商** 等列会依次隐藏；在手机上，可用性标记移到模型 id 下方，每行的两个按钮收进 ⋮ 菜单。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4676":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-23","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型列表","content":"关于这些标记：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4677":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-24","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型列表","content":"**免费** 只在站点自己说明免费时出现。没有标记不代表收费，只是站点没有说；有标记也不保证额度无限。本地模型不会自动标为免费。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4678":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-25","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型列表","content":"能力来自提供商的能力表和账号中的显式声明；站点自己公布的元数据作为补充，models.dev 只为没有声明的模型补充视觉和推理两项。推理强度档位因提供商而异，详见模型能力与推理强度。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4679":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-26","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#搜索与筛选","content":"**搜索模型**：按模型 id、提供商或显示名称搜索。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4680":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-27","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#搜索与筛选","content":"**提供商**：只看某一个提供商（**全部提供商** 恢复）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4681":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-28","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#搜索与筛选","content":"**可用性**：做过探测后出现，只列出已经出现过的结论，以及 **未探测**；**全部状态** 恢复。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4682":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-29","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#搜索与筛选","content":"没有匹配的模型时显示 **没有匹配的模型**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4683":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-30","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#目录如何加载","content":"模型目录和 Playground、设置中的模型选择器共用，以流的方式加载：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4684":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-31","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#目录如何加载","content":"先显示缓存中的模型（成功的目录会保存在数据目录的 `catalog-cache` 中，七天内有效），页面立刻可用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4685":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-32","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#目录如何加载","content":"各提供商再分别查询自己的模型列表，谁先返回先更新谁。加载过程中列表上方显示 **正在加载供应商：已完成/总数**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4686":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-33","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#目录如何加载","content":"20 秒后仍未返回的提供商标为超时。失败或超时的提供商会列在 **目录加载失败或超时：……。已保留现有模型。** 中，并附上原因（例如 **连接超时**、**代理连接失败**、**凭据被拒绝**、**地区限制**）；连接中途断开时显示 **目录连接中断，已保留收到的模型。**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4687":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-34","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#目录如何加载","content":"失败不会清空已有的模型：上一次成功的目录一直保留。失败后不会自动重试，点 **重试**（或工具栏右侧的刷新按钮）重新加载目录。某个站点的列表突然缩水到不足原来一半时，网关会先保留旧列表，等下一次查询确认后才接受。更多细节见模型能力与推理强度。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4688":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-35","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#可用性探测","content":"有些渠道的模型列表只是一串 id，看不出哪些模型在你的网络出口上真的能用。点工具栏的 **探测**，网关会在后台对这些模型逐个发一个最小的请求（一条 `ping`，最多 64 个输出 Token），根据回答给出结论。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4689":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-36","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#可用性探测","content":"默认探测的是模型列表无法说明可用性的渠道：OpenCode Zen、`agg` 聚合账号和 NVIDIA NIM（已启用的那些）。Kilo 的免费列表已经由上游筛选过，不在默认探测范围内。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4690":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-37","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#可用性探测","content":"每次最多同时探测 2 个模型，每个模型最多等 45 秒，以免触发站点的限流。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4691":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-38","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#可用性探测","content":"探测进行中按钮显示 **探测中…**，重复点击不会叠加新的一轮。结束时提示 **本轮探测结束**，列表随之更新。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4692":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-39","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#可用性探测","content":"结论保存在数据目录的 `hoshimi.db` 中，重启后仍在。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4693":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-40","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#可用性探测","content":"结论","locale":"zh-CN"},"4694":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-41","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#可用性探测","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"4695":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-42","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#可用性探测","content":"**可用**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4696":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-43","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#可用性探测","content":"模型返回了内容或 Token","locale":"zh-CN"},"4697":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-44","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#可用性探测","content":"**地区受限**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4698":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-45","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#可用性探测","content":"站点拒绝为这个网络出口服务","locale":"zh-CN"},"4699":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-46","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#可用性探测","content":"**不可用**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4700":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-47","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#可用性探测","content":"站点给出了针对这个模型的拒绝","locale":"zh-CN"},"4701":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-48","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#可用性探测","content":"**限流**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4702":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-49","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#可用性探测","content":"额度用完，没能问到模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"4703":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-50","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#可用性探测","content":"**未知**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4704":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-51","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#可用性探测","content":"凭据、网络或站点自身的错误，不能说明模型本身","locale":"zh-CN"},"4705":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-52","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#可用性探测","content":"只有 **不可用** 是针对模型本身的结论；地区受限、限流和未知都不表示模型已经没了。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4706":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-53","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#可用性探测","content":"只探测指定的模型时，可以直接调用管理接口（设置了工具访问密钥时带上它）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4707":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-54","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#可用性探测","content":"`GET /api/v1/probe` 读取最近一轮的结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4708":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-55","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#网关记住的故障","content":"除了探测，网关在正常转发时也会记住模型故障：站点对某个模型回答 404/410（或 400/422 且明确说明模型已移除）记一次，10 分钟内记满三次就在本次运行中屏蔽它。被屏蔽的模型在列表中显示为 **不可用**（优先于探测结论），对它的请求直接返回 `503 model_unavailable`，不再打扰上游。重启服务器，或调用 `POST /api/v1/models/unavailable/reset`，即可解除所有屏蔽：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4709":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-56","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#复制-id-与试用","content":"每行右侧有两个按钮：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4710":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-57","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#复制-id-与试用","content":"**复制模型 id**：把 id 复制到剪贴板，粘贴到客户端的 `model` 中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4711":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-58","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#复制-id-与试用","content":"**在 Playground 中打开**：用这个模型新开一个 Playground 对话，推理强度为 **自动**。当前对话已有内容时不会被覆盖，而是另开新对话。见 Playground。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4712":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-59","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#列表为空时","content":"**暂无模型**：还没有任何可用的渠道。到渠道页登录一个免费站点或添加 API 密钥，然后点刷新。全新安装时 OpenCode Zen 和 Kilo 无需账号即可使用，见匿名渠道。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4713":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-60","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#列表为空时","content":"某个提供商的模型没有出现：看列表上方的失败原因，再到该渠道的详情页检查账号状态和 **网络** 部分的诊断信息。常见问题见故障排查。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4714":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","type":"page","content":"概览","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","使用教程"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-overview","locale":"zh-CN"},"4715":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-0","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview","content":"概览页：今天的用量、可复制的接口地址、已启用的渠道，以及版本、更新和默认模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4716":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-1","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-overview#今日","content":"今日","locale":"zh-CN"},"4717":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-2","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-overview#接口","content":"接口","locale":"zh-CN"},"4718":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-3","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-overview#渠道","content":"渠道","locale":"zh-CN"},"4719":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-4","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-overview#服务器","content":"服务器","locale":"zh-CN"},"4720":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-5","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview","content":"**概览** 是打开界面时的第一页，一眼看清网关现在的状态。页面从上到下分为 **今日**、**接口**、**渠道** 和 **服务器** 四部分；想看更多细节时，各部分都有按钮跳到对应的页面。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4721":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-6","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#今日","content":"数字","locale":"zh-CN"},"4722":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-7","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#今日","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"4723":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-8","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#今日","content":"**token**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4724":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-9","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#今日","content":"今天所有调用的输入 + 输出 Token","locale":"zh-CN"},"4725":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-10","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#今日","content":"**调用次数**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4726":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-11","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#今日","content":"今天经过网关的请求数","locale":"zh-CN"},"4727":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-12","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#今日","content":"**缓存命中**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4728":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-13","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#今日","content":"输入 Token 中从上游缓存读取的比例","locale":"zh-CN"},"4729":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-14","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#今日","content":"**正在进行**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4730":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-15","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#今日","content":"此刻正在进行的调用数","locale":"zh-CN"},"4731":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-16","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#今日","content":"“今天”按服务器的本地时间计算。右侧的小折线是最近 24 小时每小时的 Token 量。标题旁的圆点是实时连接的状态（**实时**、**正在重连…**、**离线**）：处于 **实时** 时，调用一结束这些数字就会更新。点 **用量** 打开用量页查看图表和每次调用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4732":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-17","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#接口","content":"这一部分列出客户端要用的地址，副标题是 **Base URL**，即你打开界面所用的地址（默认 `http://127.0.0.1:10600`）。每一行右侧的按钮复制完整的 URL：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4733":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-18","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#接口","content":"路径","locale":"zh-CN"},"4734":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-19","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#接口","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"4735":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-20","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#接口","content":"`/v1/chat/completions`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4736":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-21","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#接口","content":"**Chat Completions**（OpenAI）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4737":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-22","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#接口","content":"`/v1/responses`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4738":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-23","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#接口","content":"**Responses**（OpenAI）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4739":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-24","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#接口","content":"`/v1/messages`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4740":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-25","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#接口","content":"**Anthropic Messages**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4741":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-26","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#接口","content":"`/v1/messages/count_tokens`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4742":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-27","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#接口","content":"**Token 数量估算**（Anthropic）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4743":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-28","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#接口","content":"`/v1/models`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4744":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-29","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#接口","content":"**模型列表**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4745":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-30","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#接口","content":"大多数 SDK 把 `http://127.0.0.1:10600/v1` 作为 base URL。例如：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4746":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-31","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#接口","content":"如果在 **设置 › 访问** 中设置了 **模型 API 密钥**，请求还要带上 `Authorization: Bearer <模型 API 密钥>`（或 `x-api-key`）。模型 id 可以在模型页复制。各种客户端的接法见接入客户端。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4747":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-32","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#接口","content":"列表下方的一行说明工具访问密钥的状态：**管理此服务需要工具访问密钥。** 或 **尚未设置工具访问密钥。**。没有设置工具访问密钥时，标题旁还有 **API 文档** 按钮，在新标签页中打开服务器自带的接口文档（`/docs`）。设置了密钥后这个按钮不显示，因为该页面无法携带浏览器中保存的密钥；此时可以用请求头访问 `/docs` 和 `/openapi.json`，见 API 参考。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4748":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-33","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#渠道","content":"这里列出已设置或已启用的渠道（只是可用但还没设置的站点留在渠道页）。每张卡片显示：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4749":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-34","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#渠道","content":"渠道名称和状态：**就绪**、**需要处理**、**已关闭**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4750":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-35","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#渠道","content":"账号数量，或者 **无需账户**（匿名渠道，如 OpenCode Zen 和 Kilo）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4751":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-36","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#渠道","content":"目录中来自该渠道的模型数（目录加载完成后显示）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4752":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-37","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#渠道","content":"今天用过时，显示今天的 Token 量。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4753":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-38","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#渠道","content":"点卡片直接打开该渠道的详情，点 **管理渠道** 打开渠道列表。模型目录正在加载或有提供商加载失败时，卡片上方会显示加载进度、失败的提供商及原因，以及 **重试** 按钮。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4754":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-39","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#渠道","content":"一个渠道都没有时显示 **没有启用任何提供商**。这时到 **渠道** 页登录一个免费站点或添加 API 密钥即可；不需要编辑文件，也不需要重启。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4755":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-40","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#服务器","content":"项目","locale":"zh-CN"},"4756":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-41","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#服务器","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"4757":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-42","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#服务器","content":"**版本**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4758":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-43","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#服务器","content":"正在运行的 Hoshimi 版本","locale":"zh-CN"},"4759":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-44","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#服务器","content":"**最新版本**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4760":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-45","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#服务器","content":"PyPI 上最新的正式版本，旁边标明 **有可用更新** 或 **已是最新**；还没查到时显示 **正在检查…**，从未查成功时显示 **无法检查**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4761":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-46","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#服务器","content":"**默认模型**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4762":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-47","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#服务器","content":"请求没有指定模型时使用的模型；没有设置时显示 **未设置**。在 **设置 › 常规** 中修改","locale":"zh-CN"},"4763":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-48","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#服务器","content":"服务器启动后在后台向 PyPI 查询一次，之后每天再查一次，只读取版本号，不会下载或安装任何东西。查询使用全局网络设置。不想让 Hoshimi 发出这个请求时，把 `server.check_updates` 设为 `false`，**最新版本** 一行随之隐藏：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4764":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-49","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#服务器","content":"用命令行修改配置后需要重启服务器。升级方法见安装：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4765":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","type":"page","content":"Playground","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","使用教程"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-playground","locale":"zh-CN"},"4766":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-0","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground","content":"在网页界面中与目录里的任意模型对话：保存、搜索和归档对话，附加图片与文件，编辑问题、重试和分支回复，使用斜杠命令，通过上下文压缩让长对话继续下去，以及把回复复制为 API 请求。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4767":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-1","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-playground#开始对话","content":"开始对话","locale":"zh-CN"},"4768":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-2","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-playground#打开-playground","content":"打开 Playground","locale":"zh-CN"},"4769":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-3","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-playground#选择模型","content":"选择模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"4770":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-4","page_id":"/docs/