ia-11","page_id":"/docs/providers-nvidia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-nvidia#目录","content":"适配器实时读取模型列表，并排除已识别的非聊天任务：嵌入（`embed`）、重排（`rerank`）、`nvclip`、奖励评分（`-reward`）、检测器（`-detector`）、文档解析（`nemotron-parse`）和 `gliner`。这是任务筛选，不是故障列表。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7422":{"id":"/docs/providers-nvidia-12","page_id":"/docs/providers-nvidia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-nvidia#目录","content":"模型出现在目录中，不代表当前额度可用或推理一定成功。`nvidia` 参与默认的可用性探测，可以在 **模型** 页面或通过 `POST /api/v1/probe` 实际请求一次来确认，见模型行为。能力信息和账号选项遵循同一套模型规则。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7423":{"id":"/docs/providers-nvidia-13","page_id":"/docs/providers-nvidia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-nvidia#请求转换","content":"NIM 不支持部分 OpenAI 字段，适配器在发送前做以下转换：","locale":"zh-CN"},"7424":{"id":"/docs/providers-nvidia-14","page_id":"/docs/providers-nvidia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-nvidia#请求转换","content":"转换","locale":"zh-CN"},"7425":{"id":"/docs/providers-nvidia-15","page_id":"/docs/providers-nvidia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-nvidia#请求转换","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"7426":{"id":"/docs/providers-nvidia-16","page_id":"/docs/providers-nvidia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-nvidia#请求转换","content":"移除字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"7427":{"id":"/docs/providers-nvidia-17","page_id":"/docs/providers-nvidia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-nvidia#请求转换","content":"`store`、`reasoning_effort`、`reasoning`、`prompt_cache_retention`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7428":{"id":"/docs/providers-nvidia-18","page_id":"/docs/providers-nvidia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-nvidia#请求转换","content":"`max_completion_tokens`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7429":{"id":"/docs/providers-nvidia-19","page_id":"/docs/providers-nvidia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-nvidia#请求转换","content":"没有 `max_tokens` 时改写为 `max_tokens`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7430":{"id":"/docs/providers-nvidia-20","page_id":"/docs/providers-nvidia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/prov