ders-stations-19","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/providers-stations#其他支持登录的渠道","content":"其他支持登录的渠道","locale":"zh-CN"},"7461":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-20","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations","content":"这些渠道对应各家 AI 编程工具或平台的免费、试用或订阅额度。大多数站点不提供可粘贴的 API 密钥，而是通过浏览器登录发放令牌：Hoshimi 代替官方客户端完成登录，把得到的凭据存为账号，并负责续期和签到。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7462":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-21","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations","content":"本页描述的是 Hoshimi 适配器实现了什么。各站点的免费额度、模型和规则由站点决定，随时可能变化；内置的模型列表只是站点目录不可达时的回退。实际可用以站点当前的响应为准。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7463":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-22","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#登录","content":"打开 **渠道**，在列表中选择站点（尚无账号的站点在 **未设置** 筛选下）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7464":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-23","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#登录","content":"点 **登录**。对话框依次显示 **获取链接**、**在浏览器中完成**、**已登录** 三步，并在新标签页打开站点的登录页。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7465":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-24","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#登录","content":"设备码类站点会显示 **验证码**，在授权页面输入即可。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7466":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-25","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#登录","content":"浏览器不在运行 Hoshimi 的机器上时，在 **授权码或回调地址** 中粘贴浏览器最后跳转到的地址，点 **提交授权码**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7467":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-26","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#登录","content":"成功时输出 `Signed into <渠道> as <账号 ID>.`，账号写入 `config.json`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7468":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-27","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#登录","content":"每次登录最长等待 10 分钟。网页界面中可以取消，取消后迟到的回调不会再保存账号。","loca