his version's request handling does not read it","locale":"en"},"10727":{"id":"/en/docs/config-84","page_id":"/en/docs/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/config#server","content":"`server.max_account_retries`","locale":"en"},"10728":{"id":"/en/docs/config-85","page_id":"/en/docs/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/config#server","content":"integer ≥ 1","locale":"en"},"10729":{"id":"/en/docs/config-86","page_id":"/en/docs/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/config#server","content":"`3`","locale":"en"},"10730":{"id":"/en/docs/config-87","page_id":"/en/docs/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/config#server","content":"The most accounts of one channel a request tries; see Model and account behaviour. Values below 1 count as 1","locale":"en"},"10731":{"id":"/en/docs/config-88","page_id":"/en/docs/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/config#server","content":"`server.auto_refresh`","locale":"en"},"10732":{"id":"/en/docs/config-89","page_id":"/en/docs/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/config#server","content":"boolean","locale":"en"},"10733":{"id":"/en/docs/config-90","page_id":"/en/docs/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/config#server","content":"`true`","locale":"en"},"10734":{"id":"/en/docs/config-91","page_id":"/en/docs/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/config#server","content":"Renew credentials that are about to expire on a timer (one round every 30 minutes). `false` leaves renewal to you","locale":"en"},"10735":{"id":"/en/docs/config-92","page_id":"/en/docs/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/config#server","content":"`server.auto_checkin`","locale":"en"},"10736":{"id":"/en/docs/config-93","page_id":"/en/docs/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/config#server","content":"boolean","locale":"en"},"10737":{"id":"/en/docs/config-94","page_id":"/en/docs/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/config#server","content":"`true`","locale":"en"}