ontent":"**System prompt**","locale":"en"},"12834":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-51","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#general","content":"`playground.system_prompt`","locale":"en"},"12835":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-52","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#general","content":"Sent first in every Playground chat, from its next message on. Empty sends none. A ready-made one: A system prompt for the Playground","locale":"en"},"12836":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-53","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#general","content":"**Title model**","locale":"en"},"12837":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-54","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#general","content":"`playground.title_model`","locale":"en"},"12838":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-55","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#general","content":"Names each new chat after its first reply. By default **The chat's own model**","locale":"en"},"12839":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-56","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#general","content":"**Image model**","locale":"en"},"12840":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-57","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#general","content":"`playground.vision_model`","locale":"en"},"12841":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-58","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#general","content":"Describes images for models that cannot read them. **Automatic** (the default): the first available model that reads images; **Off**: images are left out for models that cannot read them; or a particular model that reads images","locale":"en"},"12842":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-59","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#general","content":"The **Context** section, what happens as a Playground chat nears its model's context window:","locale":"en"},"12843":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-60","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#general","content":"Setting","locale":"en"},"12844":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-61","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#general","content":"Config key","locale":"en"},"12845":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-62","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#general","content":"Default","locale":"en"},"12846":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-63","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#general","content":"What it does","locale":"en"},"12847":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-64","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#general","content":"**Compact long chats automatically**","locale":"en"},"12848":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-65","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#general","content":"`playground.auto_compact`","locale":"en"},"12849":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-66","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#general","content":"On","locale":"en"},"12850":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-67","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#general","content":"Near the limit, a model summarises the chat so far and the chat goes on from the summary. A request the model refuses as too long is compacted and sent again either way","locale":"en"},"12851":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-68","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#general","content":"**Compact at (% of the window)**","locale":"en"},"12852":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-69","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#general","content":"`playground.compact_threshold`","locale":"en"},"12853":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-70","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#general","content":"85","locale":"en"},"12854":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-71","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#general","content":"50 to 95; sooner still when what is left could not hold a reply. Stored as a share (`0.85`)","locale":"en"},"12855":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-72","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#general","content":"**Summary model**","locale":"en"},"12856":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-73","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#general","content":"`playground.compact_model`","locale":"en"},"12857":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-74","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#general","content":"**The chat's own model**","locale":"en"},"12858":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-75","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#general","content":"Writes the summary when a chat is compacted","locale":"en"},"12859":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-76","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#general","content":"What these do in the Playground is in Playground.","locale":"en"},"12860":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-77","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#tools","content":"The Playground's built-in tools let models that make tool calls read and edit files, run commands and search the web. The tools switched on here are the tools of every chat; the approval mode set here is where new chats start, and each chat can change its own from the shield in its composer. The full guide is Playground tools.","locale":"en"},"12861":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-78","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#tools","content":"Commands and file edits run on this computer with the permissions of the user running Hoshimi. There is no sandbox: Automatic review has a model judge each command and edit first, and Ask first leaves every one to you.","locale":"en"},"12862":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-79","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#tools","content":"**Tools** (`playground.tools`, all on by default, for every chat):","locale":"en"},"12863":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-80","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#tools","content":"Switch","locale":"en"},"12864":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-81","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#tools","content":"Config value","locale":"en"},"12865":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-82","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#tools","content":"What it does","locale":"en"},"12866":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-83","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#tools","content":"**Read files**","locale":"en"},"12867":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-84","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#tools","content":"`read`","locale":"en"},"12868":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-85","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#tools","content":"Read text files and list folders","locale":"en"},"12869":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-86","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","