e-usage-57","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-usage#tokens-over-time","content":"Hourly detail is kept for 120 days. An older day shows **Hour-by-hour detail is not kept for this day. The totals above still include it.**","locale":"en"},"13063":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-usage-58","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-usage#speed","content":"When there are measurements, two line charts appear: **Time to first token** and **Decode speed (tok/s)**, both averages per bucket; buckets without a measurement are left as gaps rather than drawn as zero.","locale":"en"},"13064":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-usage-59","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-usage#speed","content":"Calls whose decode took less than 250 ms, or ran faster than 250 tokens a second, are left out of the averages, so a rate that could not be measured does not pass for a fast one.","locale":"en"},"13065":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-usage-60","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-usage#breakdown","content":"**Breakdown** groups usage four ways, chosen by tab:","locale":"en"},"13066":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-usage-61","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-usage#breakdown","content":"Tab","locale":"en"},"13067":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-usage-62","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-usage#breakdown","content":"One row per","locale":"en"},"13068":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-usage-63","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-usage#breakdown","content":"**Model**","locale":"en"},"13069":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-usage-64","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-usage#breakdown","content":"Model id (the display name when there is one, with the id under it)","locale":"en"},"13070":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-usage-65","page_id":"/