fig_path`."],[2667,"`GET /api/v1/settings` 返回 `data_dir` 和 `config_path`。"],[879,"`GET /app/health`"],[8700,"`GET /app/health`"],[8769,"`GET /app/health` returns `{\"status\": \"ok\", \"auth_required\": true}`, where `auth_required` says whether a tool access key is set. The Web UI uses it to decide whether to show the sign-in dialog."],[948,"`GET /app/health` 返回 `{\"status\": \"ok\", \"auth_required\": true}`，`auth_required` 表示是否设置了工具访问密钥。网页界面用它决定是否显示登录框。"],[881,"`GET /app/meta`"],[8702,"`GET /app/meta`"],[8770,"`GET /app/meta` returns:"],[949,"`GET /app/meta` 返回："],[883,"`GET /app/update`"],[8704,"`GET /app/update`"],[8787,"`GET /app/update` returns `status`, `current`, `latest` (the newest final release on PyPI, once known) and `checked_at` (Unix seconds of the last successful check). `status` is `checking` (the first check has not finished), `available`, `current`, `failed` (no check has succeeded yet; later failures keep the last good answer) or `disabled` (`server.check_updates` is off)."],[966,"`GET /app/update` 返回 `status`、`current`、`latest`（PyPI 上最新的正式版本，知道后才有）和 `checked_at`（最近一次成功检查的 Unix 秒）。`status` 为 `checking`（首次检查尚未完成）、`available`、`current`、`failed`（还没有成功过；之后的失败保留上次的结果）或 `disabled`（`server.check_updates` 关闭）。"],[877,"`GET /app/version`"],[8698,"`GET /app/version`"],[1353,"`GET /attachments/{id}`"],[9174,"`GET /attachments/{id}`"],[9484,"`GET /attachments/{id}` returns an image with its own type, a file as `text/plain`."],[1663,"`GET /attachments/{id}` 按图片自身的类型返回图片，文件以 `text/plain` 返回。"],[905,"`GET /catalog/stream`"],[8726,"`GET /catalog/stream`"],[8836,"`GET /catalog/stream` is SSE: first a `snapshot` event listing each provider's cached models (status `loading`); then a `provider` event as each provider finishes refreshing (status `ready`, `failed`, or `timeout` after 20 seconds, with `error`, `last_success`, `retry_at` and `source`); finally `done`. While waiting it sends `: keep-alive` comments."],[1015,"`GET /catalog/stream` 是 SSE：先发一个 `snapshot` 事件，列出每个渠道的缓存模型（状态 `loading`）；然后每个渠道刷新完成时发一个 `provider` 事件（状态 `ready`、`failed` 或 20 秒后的 `timeout`，附带 `error`、`last_success`、`retry_at`、`source`）；最后发 `done`。等待期间发送 `: keep-alive` 注释。"],[899,"`GET /channels`"],[8720,"`GET /channels`"],[8807,"`GET /channels` returns all the local state the Channels page needs in one read, without asking any upstream (balances need upstream requests, so they live in `/credits`):"],[986,"`GET /channels` 一次返回渠道页需要的全部本地状态，不向上游发请求（余额需要请求上游，所以不在其中，见 `/credits`）："],[1347,"`GET /conversations/{id}/context`"],[9168,"`GET /conversations/{id}/context`"],[9487,"`GET /conversations/{id}/context` says how full the conversation on screen is against its model's context window:"],[1666,"`GET /conversations/{id}/context` 返回屏幕上的对话相对于模型上下文窗口的占用情况："],[1320,"`GET /conversations/{id}/events`"],[9141,"`GET /conversations/{id}/events`"],[9395,"`GET /conversations/{id}/events` streams the reply under way from its first event (`?after=n` skips the first `n`), exactly as its send streamed them, then the rest as they come, to its `done`. Any number of clients can follow it at once. With none running it is `404`: the reply has ended, and `GET /conversations/{id}` holds it as kept."],[1574,"`GET /conversations/{id}/events` 从第一个事件起推送正在进行的回复（`?after=n` 跳过前 `n` 个），与发送时推送的事件完全相同，之后实时推送后续事件，直到 `done`。可以有任意多个客户端同时跟随。没有回复进行时返回 `404`：回复已经结束，`GET /conversations/{id}` 中是保存后的结果。"],[1317,"`GET /conversations/{id}/messages/{message_id}/request`"],[9138,"`GET /conversations/{id}/messages/{message_id}/request`"],[9510,"`GET /conversations/{id}/messages/{message_id}/request` returns the Chat Completions body behind a reply (or the one that would answer a question): `model`, `messages`, `stream: true`, `reasoning_effort` when set, and `tools` with `tool_choice` when tools are on. For a reply that used tools it is the first round. This is the Web UI's **Copy as API request**."],[1689,"`GET /conversations/{id}/messages/{message_id}/request` 返回某条回复背后的 Chat Completions 请求体（对问题则是将用来回答它的请求）