k/diagnostics` returns the latest observation of each kind of network operation per provider: `provider`, `operation`, `kind` (such as `timeout`, `proxy_error`, `connection_error`, `rate_limited`), `status`, `at`, `host`, `route`. Network settings are covered in Network and proxies."],[991,"`GET /network/diagnostics` 返回每个渠道每类网络操作最近一次的观测：`provider`、`operation`、`kind`（如 `timeout`、`proxy_error`、`connection_error`、`rate_limited`）、`status`、`at`、`host`、`route`。网络设置见网络与代理。"],[909,"`GET /probe`"],[8730,"`GET /probe`"],[8838,"`GET /probe` returns `running`, `at` (when the last round finished) and `results` (model → `state`, `detail`, `latency_ms`, `ttft_ms`, `at`). `state` is `available`, `region-blocked`, `unavailable`, `throttled` or `unknown`."],[1017,"`GET /probe` 返回 `running`、`at`（上一轮结束时间）、`results`（模型 → `state`、`detail`、`latency_ms`、`ttft_ms`、`at`）。`state` 为 `available`、`region-blocked`、`unavailable`、`throttled` 或 `unknown`。"],[891,"`GET /provider-forms`"],[8712,"`GET /provider-forms`"],[8800,"`GET /provider-forms` lists, per provider, the ways to add an account (`method`) with their fields (`key`, `kind`, `required`, `choices`) and defaults."],[979,"`GET /provider-forms` 列出每个渠道添加账号时可用的方式（`method`）及字段（`key`、`kind`、`required`、`choices`）和默认值。"],[889,"`GET /providers`"],[8710,"`GET /providers`"],[978,"`GET /providers` 的每一项：`id`、`display_name`、`accounts`（不含匿名账号）、`account_ids`、`models`（已缓存的模型数，从不为此请求上游）、`enabled`、`keyless`（无需账号即可使用）、`requires_authorization`（需要登录或 Key 才能使用）。已配置但关闭的渠道、可以登录或填 Key 但尚未配置的渠道也会列出。"],[913,"`GET /refresh`"],[8734,"`GET /refresh`"],[8841,"`GET /refresh` returns `auto_refresh` and, per account, `provider`, `account`, `refreshable`, `needs_login`, `expires_at`, `failures`, `last_error`, `last_ok`."],[1020,"`GET /refresh` 返回 `auto_refresh` 和每个账号的 `provider`、`account`、`refreshable`、`needs_login`、`expires_at`、`failures`、`last_error`、`last_ok`。"],[9511,"`GET /session` returns `{\"conversation_id\": \"...\"}`, the conversation open last (`null` when none, or when it was temporary or deleted). `PUT /session` with the same body sets it (`null` for a new chat); an unknown id is a `400`. The Web UI reopens it on start."],[1690,"`GET /session` 返回 `{\"conversation_id\": \"...\"}`，即上次打开的对话（没有，或该对话是临时对话或已删除时为 `null`）。`PUT /session` 用同样的请求体设置它（新对话时为 `null`）；ID 不存在时返回 `400`。网页界面启动时会重新打开它。"],[9180,"`GET /session`, `PUT /session`"],[1359,"`GET /session`、`PUT /session`"],[885,"`GET /settings`"],[8706,"`GET /settings`"],[8788,"`GET /settings` returns the current settings: `data_dir`, `config_path`, `server` (host, port, `strict_port`, `access_token_configured`, `model_api_key_configured`, allowed CIDRs/hosts/origins, `max_body_bytes`, `max_account_retries`, `default_model`, `auto_refresh`, `auto_checkin`, `check_updates`, `stats_keep_days`), `providers` (each provider's `id`, `enabled`, account count, the names of its options, its network settings), `network`, `playground`, and:"],[967,"`GET /settings` 返回当前设置：`data_dir`、`config_path`、`server`（地址、端口、`strict_port`、`access_token_configured`、`model_api_key_configured`、允许的 CIDR/主机/来源、`max_body_bytes`、`max_account_retries`、`default_model`、`auto_refresh`、`auto_checkin`、`check_updates`、`stats_keep_days`）、`providers`（每个渠道的 `id`、`enabled`、账号数、已设置的选项名、网络设置）、`network`、`playground`，以及："],[897,"`GET /stations`"],[8718,"`GET /stations`"],[8806,"`GET /stations` lists the stations an `agg` account can name with `preset`: `id`, `display_name`, `base_url`, `key_env` (only a hint about which key to have ready; Hoshimi does not read that variable) and `catalog_keyless`. See The agg aggregator."],[985,"`GET /stations` 列出 `agg` 账号可以用 `preset` 指定的站点：`id`、`display_name`、`base_url`、`key_env`（只是告诉你该准备哪个 Key，Hoshimi 不读取这个环境变量）、`catalog_keyless`。见 聚合入口 agg。"],[939,"`GET /stats/calls/{seq}`"],[8760,"`GET /stats/calls/{seq}`"],[8885,"`GET /stats/calls/{seq}` returns `{id, trace}`. `trace` contains `client_request`, `client_response`, the pre-conversion `request`, normalized `response` chunks and individual `upstream` exchanges. HTTP body captures include `body`, `encoding` (`utf-8` or `base64`), `bytes` and `complete`; client responses also have `finished`, which indicates capture has ended even when a disconnect leaves `complete=false`. Historical calls return `trace: null`; missing or deleted calls return 404. This endpoint requires the tool access key; a model API key cannot read it. Payloads expire or reset with their calls."],[1064,"`GET /stats/calls/{seq}` 返回 `{id, trace}`。`trace` 包含 `client_request`、`client_response`、渠道转换前的 `request`、标准化分块 `response` 和逐次上游通信 `upstream`。HTTP 正文包含 `body`、`encoding`（`utf-8` 或 `base64`）、`bytes` 与 `complete`；客户端返回另有 `finished` 表示采集已结束，即使连接中断而 `complete=false`。历史调用的 `trace` 为 `null`，不存在或已删除的调用返回 404。该接口需要工具访问密钥，模型 API 密钥不能读取它。正文随记录过期或重置时删除。"],[937,"`GET /stats/calls`"],[8758,"`GET /stats/calls`"],[8869,"`GET /stats/calls` returns individual calls, newest first, over the whole retention period (`server.stats_keep_days`, 90 days by default):"],[1048,"`GET /stats/calls` 返回逐次调用，新的在前，覆盖整个保留期（`server.stats_keep_days`，默认 90 天）："],[935,"`GET /stats/days`"],[8756,"`GET /stats/days`"],[8868,"`GET /stats/days` returns every local date with usage (`date`, `calls`, `tokens`, `failed`), oldest first, plus `first` and `today`, for a calendar."],[1047,"`GET /stats/days` 返回每个有用量的本地日期（`date`、`calls`、`tokens`、`failed`），从旧到新，以及 `first` 和 `today`，供日历使用。"],[941,"`GET /stats/live`"],[8762,"`GET /stats/live`"],[8887,"`GET /stats/live` is SSE with `data: <json>` frames: first a `snapshot` (calls in flight, today's totals, the latest calls), then `started`, `progress` and `finished` events, with a `ping` every 15 seconds. A reader that falls too far behind is disconnected; reconnecting brings a fresh snapshot. Token counts of calls in flight are estimated from characters. How usage is recorded is in Usage statistics."],[1066,"`GET /stats/live` 是 SSE，每帧 `data: <json>`：先发一个 `snapshot`（进行中的调用、今日合计、最近的调用），之后是 `started`、`progress`、`finished` 事件；每 15 秒发一次 `ping`。读取太慢跟不上时流会结束，重新连接会得到新的快照。进行中调用的 Token 数是按字符数估算的。用量的记录方式见用量统计。"],[933,"`GET /stats`"],[8754,"`GET /stats`"],[1039,"`GET /stats` 的参数："],[1090,"`GET /v1/classifiers`"],[8911,"`GET /v1/classifiers`"],[1088,"`GET /v1/models`"],[1198,"`GET /v1/models`"],[8909,"`GET /v1/models`"],[9019,"`GET /v1/models`"],[15595,"`GET /v1/models` lists each ID once; `owned_by` is the channel that wins by the order above. When the model ID itself contains a `/` (Kilo's `openrouter/free`, for example), add the channel prefix, `kilo/openrouter/free`, so the first segment is not read as a channel name. Client setup is in Connecting clients."],[7776,"`GET /v1/models` 中每个 ID 只出现一次，`owned_by` 是按上述顺序胜出的渠道。模型 ID 本身含有 `/` 时（例如 Kilo 的 `openrouter/free`），建议加上渠道前缀：`kilo/openrouter/free`，避免第一段被当成渠道名。客户端配置见接入客户端。"],[5646,"`GET /v1/models` 中每个模型的 `free` 字段有三种值：`true`、`false`、`null`（站点没有说明）。agg 只采信站点自己公布的信息："],[2415,"`GET /v1/models` 返回的 `id`，或 `渠道/模型`"],[11114,"`get_app()` in `hoshimi/cli/app.py` is the one place every command is registered; each command's implementation is in `hoshimi/cli/commands/`. Typer's private imports (`typer._click`) are confined to `hoshimi/cli/factory.py`, so a Typer release that moves them breaks there first, and the command-line tests catch it. Every command takes `--debug` to turn on debug logging. `python -m hoshimi` is the same as the `hoshimi` command."],[2120,"`GIT_PAGER`"],[9941,"`GIT_PAGER`"],[2132,"`GIT_TERMINAL_PROMPT`"],[9953,"`GIT_TERMINAL_PROMPT`"],[6520,"`github_copilot`"],[14339,"`github_copilot`"],[5938,"`github-copilot`"],[5939,"`github-copilot`"],[6521,"`github-copilot`"],[7063,"`github-copilot`"],[7166,"`github-copilot`"],[7695,"`github-copilot`"],[13757,"`github-copilot`"],[13758,"`github-copilot`"],[14340,"`github-copilot`"],[14882,"`github-copilot`"],[14985,"`github-copilot`"],[15514,"`github-copilot`"],[14923,"`github-copilot` picks Responses, Messages or Chat from the endpoints the catalogue lists for the model."],[7104,"`github-copilot` 按目录中模型支持的端点选择 Responses