d line stays in your shell history; use the Web UI to set it if that matters."],[12149,"A line longer than 500 characters is cut; one read returns at most 60,000 characters and says where to go on."],[11911,"A list that can grow without bound scrolls inside itself instead of stretching the page into an endless column"],[7928,"A little: one `ping` per model, at most 64 tokens, at most 2 at a time. By default only `opencode`, `nvidia` and `agg` are probed, the channels whose lists cannot tell availability; you can also probe specific models only."],[8304,"A login not finished within 10 minutes times out (for example `Login timed out waiting for authorization`); start again."],[11613,"A Lucide icon name in PascalCase (such as `Rocket`, `Terminal`, `Settings`)"],[12458,"A malformed pair counts as \"quota header unreadable\". Readings are kept in memory only, and the interface shows the header names, never their raw values."],[8335,"A malformed proxy URL in the environment makes requests fail rather than being ignored."],[11369,"A manual Release run"],[11464,"A manual run of the **Release** workflow in Actions runs the same checks and build first. Its `publish` input is off by default, which produces checked files only (download the `distributions` artifact to look at them); switch it on and run it on `main`, `hoshimi_main` or a tag to publish."],[8045,"A menu model that still has no matching level after this mapping uses its default level; a ladder model given an unknown level uses `balanced`."],[11632,"A Mermaid diagram that follows the site's light or dark theme"],[9470,"A message queued when the reply stops or fails is never read."],[12281,"A message sent just as the model finishes keeps the reply going for one more round, to answer it."],[9377,"A message sent with `/steer`, now read by the model: a `user` step with the `id` the steer was given"],[9675,"A Messages stream opens the upstream before sending headers, so authentication and rate-limit failures still carry 